        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_162.png[/img]\x7b%employer% is surrounded by his military men. They're wearing a great deal of pompous clothes that make you think they're a little outside their element taking on war. However, despite the rather feathery appearance, one of the commanders takes you aside with a map and speaks clearly.%SPEECH_ON%Crownling, we need you to travel to an abandoned fortress %direction% from here. We have a wing of soldiers marching to the location, but they will not beat the northern savages to it. Of anyone within reach, you are the closest. Go there and defend until our soldiers show. The fortification is decrepit, but I believe a man of your conniving nature can make do with a bit of rubble if he needs to. %reward% crowns will wait upon your return, and your success, of course.%SPEECH_OFF% | %employer% sits on a pillow with a huge rug spread out before him. Well-dressed lieutenants sit around the corners, each armed with a long wooden stick to push pieces around. And at the length of the rug are a few carpetmakers still adding to the map - as far as you can tell they are adding sections of the north. The Vizier sees you and speaks from a distance.%SPEECH_ON%Crownling, there lies a fort %direction% of here. It is a fallen fortress, made of little more than rubble some say, but the ancients built it there for good reason: it is of great strategic importance. While I have soldiers moving swiftly to its location, they will not arrive before a contingent of northerners do. Unclean savages they are, you have to respect their wile in advancing rapidly. So, I need you to occupy the fortress and hold off the northerners until my armies there.%SPEECH_OFF%He holds up a piece of paper with a number you can understand easily: %reward% crowns. | A very tall man in military garb heads you off from entering %employer%'s room. The Vizier can be heard mingling with his harem, but that's not your business. The lieutenant presses a scroll into your chest.%SPEECH_ON%The ancients built a fortress %direction% from here. It has since fallen apart, weak as all things are to the passage of time, but its location still proves strategic. We are currently moving a troop of soldiers to the location, but our scouts have relayed that the northern dogs are as aware of its import and will beat us there. That is where you come in. %reward% crowns to commandeer the fort and hold it until help arrives. Once relieved, you return to us and earn a good little Crowling's pay.%SPEECH_OFF%\x7d"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "\x7bSounds like something the %companyname% can do. | Let's talk some more about what we're paid for this. | We can hold the fortress against heathen invaders.\x7d"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "\x7bThis isn't worth it. | We're needed elsewhere. | I won't risk the company to hold some ruins.\x7d"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_167.png[/img]\x7bThe fortress is both familiar and unusual. Despite being broken apart and sliding into piles of rubble, you can't help but get a sense of eminence in its walls. Further inside, about the dilapidated armories and abandoned mess halls, there are more cursory constructs: hastily erected defenses, signs of last stands made far away from where they should be. There is no telling what happened here, or even when, but for now it will serve as the %companyname%'s temporary home.\n\n You walk to the crenelated walls and look out. It seems you have taken the position just in time: the northerners are already on the approach, a line of silhouettes marching just over the horizon like ants to their hill. | The fortress being a lost vestige of an ancient empire seems right: its constructs are as familiar as they are alien. You understand what walls are for, but you're not sure what to make of some of the symbols carved into them. Even the architecture of some of the rooms, the way the corners sweep in incredible bricked swirls, is not like anything you've seen. You're not sure if there is some tactical advantage there or perhaps its builders intended the designs to be of other import.\n\nBut there is no time to dally on the matter of its history, you're here to simply use it as a chokepoint. And it seems the time is at hand: a wave of northerners is crashing over the horizon and charging directly for you!\x7d"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "Everyone, get ready!"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "Wave1"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "Before the battle..."
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_90.png[/img]\x7bThe northern vanguard is here. You jump to the walls and shout at the %companyname% to ready themselves for battle. The sellswords jump to action, taking up positions and readying their weapons. All the while, the chink-and-chunk of northern arm claps loudly as they draw near. The first arrow sails harmlessly into the fort, a meek sign that an ugly battle is about to take place.\x7d"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_78.png[/img]\x7b%randombrother% yells out and you rush to the walls. Arrayed across the field is a contingent of heavily armed northerners. Perhaps they have learned that is the %companyname% standing before them and they wish to take the matter a mite more seriously. Not that extra caution will save them. There's only one result of facing down the %companyname% and you can't help but offer an inviting grin at the approaching assault.\x7d"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_78.png[/img]\x7bThe northerners approach once more. They march through the corpses like bream through brine, a dark knot of men and material, darkly and silhouetted in the bloody mud which you've made of the earth they dare trespass over. Rats already pecking at the dead scatter every which way and the buzzards take flight. You raise your arm and order the men to prepare for what is hopefully the final battle.\x7d"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_167.png[/img]\x7bThe first attack has been repelled. You briefly consider using the corpses to plug holes in the walls, but you've no interest inviting rats and their pestilence to the field. With a snap order, you have the bodies heaped in a pile outside the walls and then have the men prepare for the next assault.\x7d"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "Get ready for their next assault!"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_167.png[/img]\x7bThe %companyname% are almost starting to look like the men they were when you first hired them: downtrodden and beaten by the world. But all this time with the company has made them better men. Despite the exhaustion, there is no tiring out training, there is no wearing down prestige, there is no taxing renown. When it comes, the %companyname% will be ready for the next assault.\x7d"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "There may be more coming still."
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_87.png[/img]\x7bYou've seen enough of this. The Vizier tasked the company with holding for a period of time, not to sit here and commit suicide.\x7d"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "This is not worth losing the company over..."
        es = ""
    }
    {
        // this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.Contract.getFaction()).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationNobleContractFail, "Failed to hold a fortification against northern invaders");
        mode = "pattern"
        en = "<this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.m.Faction).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationContractCancel, Broke a contract)>"
        es = "<this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.m.Faction).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationContractCancel, Romper un contrato)>"
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_168.png[/img]\x7bWith bodies piling up, flies buzzing about, and buzzards circling the air in great black clouds, it appears the northerners have had enough. A horn sounds off with a defeated pitter-patter of bleats and the men lower their arms and turn back from whence they came. At the same time, a scout arrives from the south saying that %employer%'s troops will soon arrive. It seems you are safe to return to your employer.\x7d"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "We made it!"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_164.png[/img]\x7bThe northerners approach once more. They march through the corpses like bream through brine, a dark knot of men and material, darkly and silhouetted in the bloody mud which you've made of the earth they dared trespass over. Just as you raise your arms to give your men command, more men appear on the horizon. Your heart sinks for a moment, until you realize they are flying %employer%'s colors! The Vizier's men have arrived!\x7d"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "Finally, some help!"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "As you wait..."
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_90.png[/img]\x7bA blaring horn catches your attention. You go to the top of your defenses and look down to find a herald flying noble colors. He's alone, though his voice easily accounts for a full company.%SPEECH_ON%Doth thee gentle sellsword seek clemency? Doth thee gentle sellsword seek to have another 'morrow, perhaps another winter and spring? Doth thee gentle sellsword wish to liveth, so that his...%SPEECH_OFF%You yell back at him to get to the point. The man clears his throat.%SPEECH_ON%The nobles are willing to make a deal. Depart these premises at once and you will be let go without hounding. Not only this, we submit that your tablet is of wax, and to leave here is to melt its slate clean. All hostilities between the %companyname% and the North will be set aside by northern writ. That is, of course, only if you accept the offer.%SPEECH_OFF%\x7d"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "Your offer is acceptable."
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "To hell with you and your wax!"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_90.png[/img]\x7bYou take the deal. A few of the men grouse, others are relieved, though the hint of one or the other is kept very well hidden to not rouse your own suspicions no doubt. The %companyname% 'lawfully' absconds this site, and the northerners take control. You are given a number of formal scripts which carry every signature of note that could be drawn out of the northern families, and their formal stamps as well. It will carry you peacefully through northern territories, though you've no doubt earned that right with the forfeiture of good will in the south.\x7d"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "It's best for the company this way."
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "Changed sides in the war"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        // f.getFlags().set("Betrayed", true);
        mode = "pattern"
        en = "<this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.m.Faction).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationContractCancel, Broke a contract)>"
        es = "<this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.m.Faction).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationContractCancel, Romper un contrato)>"
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_90.png[/img]\x7bYou tell the herald to return to his commander. He nods.%SPEECH_ON%May thine fortitude impress the old gods, for it will not impress the might of the North.%SPEECH_OFF%The herald bows and makes his leave.\x7d"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "Get ready for their next attack."
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_168.png[/img]\x7bCorpses litter the field, sometimes piled three or four high. The men of the %companyname% walk between the bodies to loot what they can, and joining their looting are crows, buzzards, rats, mice, cats, roaming dogs, a wolf, a wildman who is too dangerous to approach, and a flock of geese who apparently found the spot warm enough to stop a seasonal migration. The Vizier's men are also here and taking over, so you yourself will need to migrate back to %employer% for your pay. | There is damp stagnation in the air with a pungent smell of copper. So thorough has the slaughter been that the earth here has turned into a swamp of blood and gore. Bodies are twisted up every which way, sometimes stacked upon each other. Sometimes you hear someone moaning, but so plentiful are the dead that it would be a waste of time to try and find the survivor. %employer%'s men will soon take over your duties, which means it is a good time to return to the Vizier for your pay.\x7d"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_04.png[/img]\x7b%employer% stops you at a good stone's throw from his throne. He snaps his fingers and a servant comes forward, but the Vizier laughs and holds up his hand.%SPEECH_ON%No wait. Have one of the women do it. Her. The ugliest one.%SPEECH_OFF%He points at his harem, and the ladies separate out until a woman is isolated from the group. She is a creature so lithe you'd imagine she would fetch a castle in the north. She takes a purse of crowns from the servant and prostrates herself before you. %employer% smirks.%SPEECH_ON%You were to hold the fort until my men arrived. Instead, you took to the feminine nature and ran at the sight of danger. Thankfully for you, my men, the real men, came to capture the fort back from the northerners and have established it as a chokepoint. Stop staring at the concubine, Crownling! Your eyes may set upon the ground or upon your pay. I suggest you take your coin and leave my sight before the Gilder's shine lights a fire beneath your very feet.%SPEECH_OFF%\x7d"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        // this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.Contract.getFaction()).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationNobleContractSuccess, "Held a fort against northerners");
        mode = "pattern"
        en = "<this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.m.Faction).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationContractCancel, Broke a contract)>"
        es = "<this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.m.Faction).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationContractCancel, Romper un contrato)>"
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_04.png[/img]\x7bYou report to %employer% everything which occurred. A smile slowly goes across the Vizier's face.%SPEECH_ON%Goodness, my lieutenants sent you there? That fort is worth nothing. Who would play such a trick? I'd have the notion to behead the man responsible, but alas, what was it, %reward_completion% crowns? It means nothing to me. I've paid more for a northern jester's jake to be told to me in person, and their sense of humor is impoverished at best. Take your gold and depart my premises, Crownling.%SPEECH_OFF% | When you return to %employer%, the Vizier is nowhere to be found. Instead, one of his lieutenants takes you aside and thanks you for your service.%SPEECH_ON%Between us and the mice, and let it be known these words were never spoken, and that there are no mice in these halls, that if I were to have men like you in my ranks I would have temptations of conquests in my heart. Alas, I am given troops as useful to me as the single grains of sand are to the desert. Here is your pay, Crown-, soldier.%SPEECH_OFF%He hands over a purse of %reward_completion% crowns. Another lieutenant starts down the hallway, and the man before you slaps you on the shoulder, his face suddenly without humor or congeniality.%SPEECH_ON%Get out of here, Crownling, that is your pay and we will not hear so much as a single syllable from a haggler's tongue!%SPEECH_OFF% | You enter the Vizier's halls only to find a lone man sweeping the marbled floors. His broom's bristles scratch to a stop on your boot and he looks up.%SPEECH_ON%Ah. They told me a man of your stature would be here.%SPEECH_OFF%He sets the broom down, its handle possibly thicker than his frail frame. He walks over to a table and opens a chest filled with trays of %reward_completion% crowns. You ask how the Viziers would ever trust him with so much coin. The man picks up his broom and laughs.%SPEECH_ON%Were I to steal the crowns for myself, how far would I get? It is heavy. I cannot carry it all. So can I take a little? No. I'm a man of no material presence. As surely as the Gilder's eye blossoms the flower, gold in my palm illuminates me as a thief. I would never get far. This here is my station, and this is yours.%SPEECH_OFF%You take the coin, but then ask how he knows you're the right sellsword. His broom scratches to a stop again, and a bead of sweat slowly goes down his cheek. Before he answers, you take the crowns and go. | %employer% is found amongst his council. The rarely seen knot of silk-wearing, beard stroking peoples regard you with contempt. You state loudly that the fort has been held and taken by the southern soldiers. All noise is ceased and your words echo about the marbled halls and every servant stops and the council pauses. %employer% stands up.%SPEECH_ON%Servants, fetch this wagging tongue his coin.%SPEECH_OFF%One of the councilmen spits, which a collared child quickly cleans up.%SPEECH_ON%Should have remitted his pay while he was at the fort. How dare he so much as breathe in this room.%SPEECH_OFF%Servants rush to your side with purses of %reward_completion% crowns. The Vizier waves his hand.%SPEECH_ON%Begone, Crownling. I've persons I hire to dally, and you are not one of them.%SPEECH_OFF%\x7d"
        es = ""
    }
    // FILE: D:\GOG\Battle Brothers\!Downloads\bbros\bin\comparer\original_current\scripts\contracts\contracts\hunting_alps_contract.nut
    {
        en = "Ending the Nightmare"
        es = "Poniendo Fin a las Pesadillas"
    }
    {
        en = "alps"
        es = "ladrones de sueños"
    }
    {
        en = "dreamstealers"
        es = "ladrones de almas"
    }
    {
        en = "soulstealers"
        es = "acechadores nocturnos"
    }
    {
        en = "nightstalkers"
        es = "terrores nocturnos"
    }
    {
        en = "nachtmars"
        es = "alps"
    }
    {
        en = "aufhockers"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "nightterrors"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "nightcreepers"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        // "End the nightmares haunting " + this.Contract.m.Home.getName() + " at night"
        mode = "pattern"
        en = "End the nightmares haunting <this.Contract.m.Home.getName()> at night"
        es = "Pon fin a las pesadillas que atormentan a <this.Contract.m.Home.getName()> por la noche"
    }
    {
        en = "Encounter"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "Banter"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_79.png[/img]\x7b%employer% is found with a pillow in hand. A man at his side is touching its linens before bringing it to his nose. He sniffed it thrice and then shook his head before seeing fit to sniff it again anyway. %employer% waves you in.%SPEECH_ON%A peasant around these parts is reporting that a strange spirit is invading his sleep. He's offered his nightly adornments as evidence, but we know not what to make of them.%SPEECH_OFF%You look at the strange man who is nose deep in the linens again. You raise an eyebrow and state you can investigate this matter yourself. %employer% nods.%SPEECH_ON%Precisely why I'm glad you're here. I want you to stick around a night or two and see if anything spooky comes out at night. I'm sure it's nothing, but I'll pay you regardless of what shows. What say you, does this pique your interest?%SPEECH_OFF%The strange man is almost clutching into the pillow and drawing in gaping breaths as though suffocating himself. He asks if he can keep the pillow. | %employer% brings you to his desk where there's a scattering of drawings.%SPEECH_ON%I don't frequently give out my papers and pens to the local folk, but a handful of families demanded they draw out what they'd seen.%SPEECH_OFF%You take a look. Every page is different, most consisting of stick figures in rather chaotic arrangements. One of the more artistic drawings is of a strange beast crouched over a person and clutching their head as though to steal away with it. The townsman continues.%SPEECH_ON%Look like ordinary nightmares to me, but I investigated the homes and each did look mightily disturbed, as though something was slinking about while they'd slept. I want you to stick around, sellsword, and see what comes. It's probably just hooligans, but worth a look. Are you interested?%SPEECH_OFF% | You find %employer% listening to a peasant tell a tale, but upon seeing you the man suggests the layman tell it to you instead. He explains that he and many other families have been suffering horrible dreams lately. Not only this, but pets have gone missing and some children have reported being stolen away and having to walk back to their homes in the dead of night. %employer% nods.%SPEECH_ON%The whole town is on pins and needles about this, sellsword. I've heard tales of %enemy%, ghoulish cretins that feast upon one's dreams, but I'm sure it's just some damn kids up to no good. Either way, a purse has been collected and I'm prepared to dole it out for more proper protection. Are you interested?%SPEECH_OFF% | %employer% sits at his desk. He sighs heavily.%SPEECH_ON%Damn peasants are going on about %enemy% this, %enemy% that. Seems like a mountain of shit on my shoulders these days, or a mountain range even!%SPEECH_OFF%The man takes a seat and pours himself a mug of ale. He downs it quickly.%SPEECH_ON%Dream eaters this, stalkers of the night that, bah! Absolute rubbish. Well, the fools put together a chest of coin and are willing to give it out for some protection. I want you to stick around a night or two and see if these supposed spirits are real or we just got some tricksters on our hands. Are you interested?%SPEECH_OFF% | %employer% has his head in his hands and it turns side to side. You ask if you should come back another time. He slams his fists into the table.%SPEECH_ON%No! This is the perfect time. The townsfolk have been complaining of strange dreams for days now. And last night a nightmare visited upon me. I can't even make sense of it. I was standing in a field of wheat and I saw shadows passing through the stalks. But they weren't just shadows, they were flattening the wheat as they went and... well, when I woke I saw the legs of something just as they ran out my door. I... I mean we want you to stay the night and see if anything comes for you, too. Are you interested?%SPEECH_OFF% | You find %employer% flipping through a tome. Dust flutters with every page turn. He speaks without looking up.%SPEECH_ON%The town has collected payment for you to stay the night.%SPEECH_OFF%Grinning, you ask if there's a free meal with that offer. The man slowly closes the book. He looks at you rather plainly as if you'd said nothing at all.%SPEECH_ON%There is fear of bizarre monsters afoot, things that feed upon dreams. I thought it the error of superstition, but they came to me last night and I stared into its eyes. I woke in the attic praying to Davkul. What the fark is Davkul? Gods I know not what is going on, but I sure hope you take this offer. Stay through a night or two and see if we've more than rumor to fear out here.%SPEECH_OFF% | %employer% is found turning a small wooden trinket between his thumb and finger. It is shaped like a horned man. He throws it on his desk and nods at it.%SPEECH_ON%Carpenter made that. Said it visited him in the night. I said when. He said in his dreams, and it was at the foot of his bed when he awoke. Then, today, three entire families come to me stating they'd seen the same and that every one of their dogs are missing. Not found. Just gone. I know not what festers in these ungodly parts, sellsword, but I won't spend another night without some steel at our side. Are you interested in protecting %townname% for a night or two?%SPEECH_OFF%\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_79.png[/img]\x7b%employer% se encuentra con una almohada en la mano. Un hombre a su lado está tocando sus sábanas antes de acercarlas a su nariz. Las olió tres veces y luego negó con la cabeza antes de considerar olerlas nuevamente de todos modos. %employer% te hace un gesto para que te acerques.%SPEECH_ON%Un campesino de por aquí está informando que un espíritu extraño está invadiendo su sueño. Ha ofrecido sus adornos nocturnos como evidencia, pero no sabemos qué hacer con ellos.%SPEECH_OFF%Miras al extraño hombre que está metiendo la nariz en las sábanas de nuevo. Levantas una ceja y declaras que puedes investigar este asunto por ti mismo. %employer% asiente.%SPEECH_ON%Por eso me alegra que estés aquí. Quiero que te quedes una noche o dos y veas si algo espeluznante sale por la noche. Estoy seguro de que no es nada, pero te pagaré independientemente de lo que aparezca. ¿Qué dices, te interesa esto?%SPEECH_OFF%El extraño hombre está casi abrazando la almohada y respirando con bocanadas profundas como si se estuviera sofocando. Pregunta si puede quedarse con la almohada. | %employer% te lleva a su escritorio donde hay varios dibujos dispersos.%SPEECH_ON%No suelo dar mis papeles y plumas a la gente local, pero un puñado de familias exigió poder dibujar lo que habían visto.%SPEECH_OFF%Le echas un vistazo. Cada página es diferente, la mayoría consiste en figuras simples dispuestas de manera bastante caótica. Uno de los dibujos más artísticos es de una extraña bestia agachada sobre una persona y agarrándole la cabeza como si quisiera llevársela. El concejal del pueblo continúa.%SPEECH_ON%Me parece que son pesadillas comunes, pero investigué las casas y todas parecían muy perturbadas, como si algo se hubiera arrastrado mientras dormían. Quiero que te quedes, mercenario, y veas qué sucede. Probablemente sean simplemente alborotadores, pero vale la pena echar un vistazo. ¿Estás interesado?%SPEECH_OFF% | Encuentras a %employer% escuchando a un campesino contar una historia, pero al verte, el hombre sugiere que el campesino te la cuente en su lugar. Explica que él y muchas otras familias han estado sufriendo horribles sueños últimamente. No solo eso, sino que las mascotas han desaparecido y algunos niños han informado que los han raptado y que han tenido que volver a sus hogares en plena noche.%employer% asiente.%SPEECH_ON%Toda la ciudad está nerviosa por esto, mercenario. He oído hablar de %enemy%, unos engendros que se alimentan de los sueños, pero estoy seguro de que son solo algunos malditos niños haciendo travesuras. De todos modos, se ha recolectado una bolsa de dinero y estoy dispuesto a repartirla por una protección más adecuada. ¿Te interesa esto?%SPEECH_OFF% | %employer% está sentado en su escritorio. Suspira con fuerza.%SPEECH_ON%Los malditos campesinos no paran de hablar de %enemy% esto, %enemy% aquello. Parece que tengo una montaña de mierda en mis hombros estos días, ¡o incluso una cadena montañosa entera!%SPEECH_OFF%El hombre se sienta y se sirve una jarra de cerveza. Se la bebe rápidamente.%SPEECH_ON%Devoradores de sueños por aquí, acosadores de la noche por allá, ¡bah! Un completo absurdo. Bueno, los tontos han reunido un cofre de monedas y están dispuestos a darlo por algo de protección. Quiero que te quedes una o dos noches y veas si estos supuestos espíritus son reales o si simplemente tenemos algunos bromistas entre manos. ¿Te interesa esto?%SPEECH_OFF% | %employer% tiene la cabeza entre las manos y la sacude de un lado a otro. Preguntas si debes volver en otro momento. Él golpea la mesa con los puños.%SPEECH_ON%¡No! Este es el momento perfecto. Los habitantes del pueblo han estado quejándose de extraños sueños durante días. Y anoche una pesadilla me visitó. Ni siquiera puedo entenderlo. Estaba parado en un campo de trigo y vi sombras pasando entre las espigas. Pero no eran solo sombras, aplastaban el trigo a medida que avanzaban y... bueno, cuando desperté vi las patas de algo justo cuando salían por mi puerta. Yo... quiero decir, queremos que te quedes la noche y veas si algo viene por ti también. ¿Te interesa esto?%SPEECH_OFF% | Encuentras a %employer% hojeando un tomo. El polvo revolotea con cada vuelta de página. Habla sin mirar apartar la vista de las páginas.%SPEECH_ON%El pueblo ha recaudado un pago para que te quedes esta noche.%SPEECH_OFF%Sonriendo, preguntas si hay una comida gratis con esa oferta. El hombre cierra lentamente el libro. Te observa con la mirada fija como si no hubieras dicho nada en absoluto.%SPEECH_ON%Hay miedo de que haya monstruos extraños merodeando, cosas que se alimentan de los sueños. Pensé que era un error de la superstición, pero vinieron a mí la noche pasada y pude ver sus ojos. Desperté en el ático rezando a Davkul. ¿Qué diablos es Davkul? Dioses, no sé qué está pasando, pero espero que aceptes esta oferta. Quédate una o dos noches y descubre si tenemos algo más que rumores que temer aquí.%SPEECH_OFF% | %employer% se encuentra dando vueltas a un pequeño objeto de madera entre su pulgar y su dedo. Tiene forma de un hombre cornudo. Lo tira sobre su escritorio y asiente ante él.%SPEECH_ON%El carpintero lo hizo. Dijo que lo visitó por la noche. Le pregunté cuándo. Dijo que en sus sueños, y que estaba al pie de su cama cuando despertó. Luego, hoy, tres familias enteras vinieron a mí diciendo que habían visto lo mismo y que todos sus perros han desaparecido. Sin rastro. Simplemente por la mañana ya no estaban. No sé qué está maldición nos acecha, mercenario, pero no pasaré otra noche sin algo de acero a nuestro lado. ¿Te interesa proteger %townname% durante una o dos noches?%SPEECH_OFF%\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "\x7bHow many crowns can you muster? | Let's talk pay. | Let's talk crowns. | We could look into this. For the right price.\x7d"
        es = "\x7b¿De cuántas coronas estamos hablando? | Hablemos del pago. | Hablemos de coronas. | Podríamos investigar esto... por el precio adecuado.\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "\x7bThis doesn't sound like mercenary work. | This doesn't sound like our kind of work. | That's not the kind of work we're looking for.\x7d"
        es = "\x7bEsto no suena como un trabajo de mercenario. | Esto no parece ser nuestro tipo de trabajo. | Este no es el tipo de trabajo que estamos buscando.\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_79.png[/img]\x7bAs you pass the time, an old man comes down the path. Without any prompting, he states that if it is the pale men you seek then it is best you wait til night. %randombrother% asks what he means by pale men. The old man laughs.%SPEECH_ON%Truthfully, they is neither pale nor men, but I don't know how else to put them in this world. My elders called them %enemy%, monsters that put ill notions and visions in your head and then feed on the fear which crops. But yer a sturdy lot, ye'll do well.%SPEECH_OFF%He thumbs his nose and wishes you good luck. | While you're checking your map and getting a lay of the land, %randombrother% comes up with an elderly woman at his side. She's looks old as oak and waves you down with a trembling hand. You lend an ear and she speaks in a coarse tone.%SPEECH_ON%They come at night. Them and their visions.%SPEECH_OFF%She raises a finger.%SPEECH_ON%Only at night! They live for corruption. Not of the land, but of your mind. My mother called them %enemy%, givers of apparitions and the unreal. When you find them, you will hear the hissing of your sanity slipping away. Hold it tight and ye shall survive yet.%SPEECH_OFF% | %randombrother% comes to your side. He says that he's heard of these beasts before.%SPEECH_ON%Ye old monster tale about things which squat in your windowsill and watch you sleep, or they climb up on your bedrest and peel your dreams open and look in. Some say it ain't none of that. They say they can get ya while yer awake, put visions right in yer noggin to see things that ain't there.%SPEECH_OFF% | %randombrother% comes to you with a pensive look on his face. He explains that a long time ago he knew a man that'd been hanged for a murder. Said he chopped his children to bits. But the accused stated he'd just been butchering the chickens. Saw them and their feathers, said they was nothing if not fowl. He said when he came to and saw the atrocity before him that a beast snickered from his windowsill, squattin' there giggling all smarmlike. The sellsword nods.%SPEECH_ON%When they hanged that fella they said he yelled out at something and ran off the stool. Said he kept running, said he kept spitting vengeance despite the rope ripping his neck up onto his ears.%SPEECH_OFF% | %randombrother% comes to you with a scouting report. He states that locals haven't seen any beast, but they have been seeing things in the unusual way. When you ask for an explanation, the sellsword shrugs.%SPEECH_ON%I couldn't put it rightly, sir. Seems to me they're just seeing things. Visions and the like. I ain't one to trust such nonsense, but they was earnest about the matter.%SPEECH_OFF% | As you pass the time, an old man comes down the path. Without any prompting, he states that if it is the pale men you seek then it is best you wait til night. %randombrother% asks what he means by pale men. The old man laughs.%SPEECH_ON%Truthfully, they is neither pale nor men, but I don't know how else to put them in this world. My elders called them alps, monsters that plant nightmares in your head and feed on the fears which crop.%SPEECH_OFF%He thumbs his nose and wishes you good luck. | While you're checking your map and getting a lay of the land, %randombrother% comes up with an elderly woman at his side. She's looks old as oak and waves you down with a trembling hand. You lend an ear and she speaks in a coarse tone.%SPEECH_ON%They come at night.%SPEECH_OFF%She raises a finger.%SPEECH_ON%Only at night! They live for corruption. Not of the land, but of your mind. My mother called them %enemy%. When you find them, you will hear the hissing of your sanity slipping away. Hold it tight.%SPEECH_OFF% | %randombrother% comes to your side. He says that he's heard of these beasts before.%SPEECH_ON%You hear whispers about them now and again. Things which squat in your windowsill and watch you sleep, or they climb up on your bedrest and peel your dreams open and look in. They call them alps and the way I understand it they only come out at night. If they exist at all, of course.%SPEECH_OFF%\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_79.png[/img]\x7bMientras pasas el tiempo, un anciano se acerca por el camino. Sin que nadie lo pregunte, dice que si buscas a los hombres pálidos, lo mejor es que esperes hasta la noche. %randombrother% pregunta a qué se refiere con hombres pálidos. El anciano se ríe.%SPEECH_ON%La verdad es que no son ni pálidos ni hombres, pero no sé cómo más describirlos con palabras de este mundo. Mis mayores los llamaban %enemy%, monstruos que siembran nociones y visiones enfermizas en tu mente y luego se alimentan del miedo que crecen. Pero sois un grupo robusto, lo haréis bien.%SPEECH_OFF%Se suena la nariz y te desea buena suerte. | Mientras estás revisando tu mapa y entendiendo la disposición del terreno, %randombrother% se acerca con una anciana a su lado. Parece vieja como un roble y te llama con una mano temblorosa. Le prestas atención y ella habla con un tono áspero.%SPEECH_ON%Vienen por la noche. Ellos y sus visiones.%SPEECH_OFF%Ella levanta un dedo.%SPEECH_ON%¡Solo por la noche! Viven para la corrupción. No de la tierra, sino de tu mente. Mi madre los llamaba %enemy%, dadores de apariciones y de lo irreal. Cuando los encuentres, escucharás el siseo de tu cordura desvaneciéndose. Centra tu mente y sobrevivirás.%SPEECH_OFF% | %randombrother% se acerca a tu lado con una mirada pensativa. Explica que hace mucho tiempo conocía a un hombre que había sido ahorcado por un asesinato. Dijo que había despedazado a sus hijos. Pero el acusado afirmó que solo estaba descuartizando a las gallinas. Los vio a ellos y a sus plumas, dijo que no eran más que aves. Dijo que cuando se dio cuenta y vio la atrocidad frente a él, una bestia se rió desde su alféizar, agachada allí riéndose todo el tiempo. El mercenario asiente.%SPEECH_ON%Cuando ahorcaron a ese tipo, dijo que gritó a algo y salió corriendo del taburete. Dijo que siguió corriendo, dijo que siguió escupiendo venganza a pesar de que la cuerda le desgarró el cuello hasta las orejas.%SPEECH_OFF% | %randombrother% se acerca a ti con una mirada reflexiva. Dice que ha oído hablar de estas bestias antes.%SPEECH_ON%La vieja historia del monstruo sobre cosas que se agachan en el alféizar de tu ventana y te observan mientras duermes, o suben a tu cama y abren tus sueños para mirar dentro. Algunos dicen que no es nada de eso. Dicen que pueden atraparte mientras estás despierto, poner visiones en tu cabeza para ver cosas que no están ahí.%SPEECH_OFF% | %randombrother% se acerca a ti con un informe de reconocimiento. Afirma que los lugareños no han visto ninguna bestia, pero han estado viendo cosas de manera inusual. Cuando le pides una explicación, el mercenario encoge los hombros.%SPEECH_ON%No podría explicarlo con certeza, capitán. Me parece que están viendo cosas. Visiones y cosas por el estilo. Yo no soy de confiar en tales tonterías, pero parecían sinceros sobre el asunto.%SPEECH_OFF% | %randombrother% se acerca a tu lado. Dice que ha oído hablar de estas bestias antes.%SPEECH_ON%Escuchas rumores sobre ellos de vez en cuando. Cosas que se agachan en el alféizar de tu ventana y te observan mientras duermes, o suben a tu cama y abren tus sueños para mirar dentro. Los llaman alps y por lo que entiendo, solo salen por la noche. Si es que existen, por supuesto.%SPEECH_OFF%\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "\x7bKeep your eyes peeled. | We need to be ready for this. | Stay awake, people.\x7d"
        es = "\x7bMantened los ojos abiertos. | Tenemos que estar preparados para esto. | Manteneos despiertos, hombres.\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_102.png[/img]\x7b%randombrother% hurriedly comes to your side.%SPEECH_ON%Something's moving just yonder.%SPEECH_OFF%You take your eyes to the perimeter of the patrol. Whatever it is, it's not moving so much as slipping over the ground. It looks like a skinned deer pacing backwards and its eyes leave streams of jet black behind as though to etch horror itself over the earth. You tell the men to grab their weapons. | Assessing your map by a torchlight, you suddenly see a black shape bounding through the darkness. It is a mess of limbs cartwheeling over the earth, flailing forward with unseemly speed. It stalks as low as a snake, yet you hear the choking snarl of someone dying in their sleep. You order the men to arms. | A pale shape stalks the rim of the company's patrol. It crouches in the tall grass and stares at the company. Finally, you walk forward and hold your arms out and close your eyes. Immediately, %randombrother% calls out.%SPEECH_ON%Sir get back! Sir, oh by the gods there are more!%SPEECH_OFF%You open your eyes and nod. Finally, they've come.\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_102.png[/img]\x7b%randombrother% se acerca apresuradamente a tu lado.%SPEECH_ON%Algo se mueve justo allí.%SPEECH_OFF%Diriges la mirada hacia el perímetro de la patrulla. Sea lo que sea, más que moverse parece como que se desliza por el suelo. Parece un ciervo sin piel que avanza hacia atrás, y sus ojos dejan tras de sí corrientes de un negro azabache, como si quisieran grabar el horror mismo en la tierra. Les ordenas a los hombres que tomen sus armas. | Mientras evalúas tu mapa bajo la luz de una antorcha, de repente ves una forma negra que corre veloz por la oscuridad. Es un revoltijo de extremidades dando vueltas sobre la tierra, avanzando con una velocidad inconcebible. Se arrastra tan bajo como una serpiente, pero escuchas el gruñido asfixiante de alguien muriendo en su sueño. Ordenas a los hombres que se armen. | Una figura pálida acecha en el borde de la patrulla de la compañía. Se agacha entre la hierba alta y observa a la compañía. Aturdido, avanzas y extiendes los brazos, cerrando los ojos. Inmediatamente, %randombrother% exclama.%SPEECH_ON%¡Capitán, retroceda! ¡Jefe, por los dioses, hay más!%SPEECH_OFF%Abres los ojos despejandote y asientes. Finalmente, han llegado.\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_122.png[/img]\x7bThe monsters are slain. You take your sword and hack into one's neck. The blade cuts through with complete ease and the head lolls off into the grass. Its eyesockets are barren and concave. There's nothing inside, no flesh, no muscle. Whatever. You tell the men to get ready for a return march to %employer%. | The alps lay in the grass and though you know you saw them hurt, their flesh seems to have healed over and they seem more slain by your resilience than any weapon. You take your sword to saw a head off, only to find the blade slides right through the skin and the neckhole puckers closed. You stab the body a few times, twisting the blade to rend the flesh unmendable. Sinews slither briefly before coming to rest in the wound's hole. Not sure what to make of that, you shovel the head into a bag and tell the men ready a return to %employer%.\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_122.png[/img]\x7bLas criaturas son abatidas. Tomas tu espada y la clavas en el cuello de una de ellas. La hoja corta con total facilidad y la cabeza cae en la hierba. Sus cuencas oculares están vacías y cóncavas. No hay nada en su interior, ni carne, ni músculo. Lo que sea. Les dices a los hombres que se preparen para regresar con %employer%. | Los alps yacen en la hierba y, aunque sabes que los heriste, su carne parece haber sanado y parecen más derrotados por tu resistencia que por cualquier arma. Tomas tu espada para cortar una cabeza, solo para descubrir que la hoja atraviesa la piel sin dificultad y el agujero del cuello se cierra. Apuñalas el cuerpo varias veces, girando la hoja para desgarrar la carne de manera irreparable. Los tendones se deslizan brevemente antes de detenerse en el agujero de la herida. Sin saber qué pensar de eso, metes la cabeza en una bolsa y les dices a los hombres que se preparen para regresar con %employer%.\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "Payment awaits."
        es = "El pago espera."
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_79.png[/img]\x7b%employer% asks to see the alp's remains. You take it out of the bag. The flesh has deflated and you hold the head more like a scalp than a skull. The townsman touches it with his finger and the alp skin twists away like snakeskin. He asks if they fought well. You shrug.%SPEECH_ON%Hardy creatures to be certain, but I won't lose sleep over them.%SPEECH_OFF%The man nods reluctantly.%SPEECH_ON%Right. Well, here is your reward as promised. And throw that awful thing away.%SPEECH_OFF% | You dump the alp's head onto %employer%'s desk. It flops over the wood until its maw rests wide, its emptied eyesockets drooping sadly at the world above. %employer% takes a fire iron and fishes around the skull before hanging its shapelessness in the air.%SPEECH_ON%What an awful thing this is. I should let you know that many folks came to me just hours ago stating they'd visions of fields being bathed in a glorious light. Like they'd dreamt the renewal of the world whole. So I don't know if every last one of these monsters is gone, but it seems %townname%'s plight has been well taken care of. I'll see to it that you get your reward as promised.%SPEECH_OFF% | %employer% meets you in his room and laughs at the knapsack you've brought. He shakes his head as he pours a drink.%SPEECH_ON%You need not show me that foul thing's face, sellsword. It visited me just hours ago, while I was sitting right there writing notes, an intrusion that was a dream, a sight of its death as though its spirit had been severed from mine and I was forced to see it go. And in its leaving I saw you standing there, sword in hand, victorious as all get out.%SPEECH_OFF%You nod and ask if you looked good. He laughs.%SPEECH_ON%You looked a slayer of worlds, certainly a slayer of that creature's world and, I must fear, perhaps a bit of mine as well. Stolen, permanently. Well, no matter, I as a man whole or a man sundered, I've promised you a good pay and here it is.%SPEECH_OFF%\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_79.png[/img]\x7b%employer% pide ver los restos del alp. Sacas la cabeza de la bolsa. La carne ha perdido su hinchazón y sostienes la cabeza más como un cuero cabelludo que como un cráneo. El habitante de la ciudad lo toca con el dedo y la piel del alp se retuerce como la piel de una serpiente. Te pregunta si lucharon bien. Encoges los hombros.%SPEECH_ON%Criaturas resistentes, sin duda, pero no perderé el sueño por ellas.%SPEECH_OFF%El hombre asiente pensativo.%SPEECH_ON%Entiendo. Bueno, aquí tienes tu recompensa como se te prometió. Y tira esa cosa espantosa.%SPEECH_OFF% | Dejas caer la cabeza del alp en el escritorio de %employer%. Se tambalea sobre la madera hasta que su boca descansa abierta, sus órbitas vacías miran tristemente hacia arriba. %employer% toma un hierro de chimenea y lo introduce en el cráneo antes de sostener su forma en el aire.%SPEECH_ON%Qué cosa tan espantosa es esta. Debo informarte que muchas personas vinieron a mí hace solo unas horas diciendo que habían tenido visiones de campos bañados en una luz gloriosa. Como si hubieran soñado la renovación del mundo entero. Así que no sé si todos y cada uno de estos monstruos se han ido, pero parece que el problema de %townname% ha sido resuelto de manera adecuada. Me aseguraré de que recibas tu recompensa como se te prometió.%SPEECH_OFF% | %employer% se encuentra contigo en su habitación y se ríe de la bolsa que has traído. Niega con la cabeza mientras se sirve una bebida.%SPEECH_ON%No necesitas mostrarme la cara de esa cosa repugnante, mercenario. Me visitó hace solo unas horas, mientras estaba sentado aquí mismo escribiendo notas, una intrusión que fue un sueño, una visión de su muerte como si su espíritu hubiera sido separado del mío y me viera obligado a verlo partir. Y al irse, te vi a ti de pie allí, espada en mano, victorioso en todo su esplendor.%SPEECH_OFF%Asientes y preguntas si lucías bien. Él se ríe.%SPEECH_ON%Lucías como un exterminador de mundos, ciertamente un exterminador del mundo de esa criatura y, temo decirlo, quizás un poco del mío también. Robado, permanentemente. Bueno, no importa, como un hombre íntegro o como un hombre desgarrado, te he prometido un buen pago y aquí está.%SPEECH_OFF%\x7d"
    }
    {
        // this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.Contract.getFaction()).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationCivilianContractSuccess, "Rid the town of unnatural nightmares");
        mode = "pattern"
        en = "<this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.m.Faction).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationContractCancel, Broke a contract)>"
        es = "<this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.m.Faction).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationContractCancel, Romper un contrato)>"
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_33.png[/img]\x7bYou wager the men have earned themselves a good rest and take a break in %townname%. The men spend the nap in slumbers so deep they might as well be dead. Awaking, the men stretch and yawn. Not a one has a dream or nightmare to speak of, the snooze but a brief touch of oblivion, and a much needed one at that.\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_33.png[/img]\x7bApuestas a que los hombres se han ganado un buen descanso y haces una parada en %townname%. Los hombres pasan la siesta en un sueño tan profundo que bien podrían estar muertos. Al despertar, los hombres se estiran y bostezan. Ninguno tiene un sueño o pesadilla de la que hablar, la siesta es apenas un breve toque de olvido, y muy necesario, por cierto.\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "I feel refreshed!"
        es = "¡Me siento renovado!"
    }
    {
        en = "Refreshed from having a great night's sleep"
        es = "Te sientes renovado de tener una gran noche de sueño"
    }
    {
        en = "enemy"
        es = ""
    }
    // FILE: D:\GOG\Battle Brothers\!Downloads\bbros\bin\comparer\original_current\scripts\contracts\contracts\hunting_hexen_contract.nut
    {
        en = "A Pact With Witches"
        es = "Un pacto con las brujas"
    }
    {
        en = "Stay around %townname% and protect %employer%'s firstborn son"
        es = "Permanece en %townname% y protege al primogénito de %employer%"
    }
    {
        en = "Curse"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_79.png[/img]\x7bYou find %employer% with a scapula around his neck, though its ordinary thaumaturgical arrangements have been replaced with garlic and onions. He has tears in his eyes.%SPEECH_ON%Oh sellsword am I glad to see you! Please, sit.%SPEECH_OFF%Ducking under herb-heavy streamers, you come and sit before the man. Your eyes slim and begin to water. He continues.%SPEECH_ON%Look, this is going to make me sound like the biggest goddam fool you've ever come by, but listen. Many years ago my firstborn, %protectee%, came into this world clothed in illness. Desperate, I sought the aid of witches...%SPEECH_OFF%You hold up your hand. You ask him if he made a pact and if they're here to collect on the debt. The man nods.%SPEECH_ON%Aye. Eighteen years is what they promised and tonight is his eighteenth upon the earth. This is no simple task, sellsword. These women are dangerous beyond any steel's proper reckoning, and I wager they'll be all the more hellish once they learn I refuse to pay. Are you sure you wish to help me protect my child?%SPEECH_OFF%Wiping your eyes, you weigh the options... | %employer% is found in the corner of his room. He's contorted to look out the window like a marmot from its warren. Seeing your shadow stretch over him, he leaps and clutches his chest. His wink of cowardice is no laughing matter, though, and he comes to you earnestly.%SPEECH_ON%Witches have hexed my family! Well, hexed my bloodline. Well, more specifically my firstborn, %protectee%. Many moons ago I struggled to put it in... you know, with the wife. I asked the witches for help and they brewed me something proper for the bedroom. Of course, witches being what they is, they're now back and asking to take my firstborn away!%SPEECH_OFF%You're amazed that witches would do that to him and express your sympathy. %employer% snaps at you.%SPEECH_ON%This is no joking matter! I need protection for my firstborn, are you willing to help save %protectee% or not?%SPEECH_OFF% | You find %employer% fervently flipping through books. It's in a manner which suggests he's pored over them previously and now he's just hurriedly hunting for any missed clue. There is none and he throws the tomes off his table with a burst of anger. Seeing you, he wipes his forehead and explains.%SPEECH_ON%I've searched high and low for an answer, but it seems I will have to resort to steel. That would be your steel, sellsword. I'll be honest with you. I made dealings with witches many years ago to protect my firstborn, %protectee%, from a hellish fever. The child survived, but now those awful women are coming back and demand my child as payment.%SPEECH_OFF%You nod. This is almost as bad as the schemes of some loan sharks. He continues, poling a finger into the desk.%SPEECH_ON%I need you here, sellsword. I need a sword to protect %protectee% through the night, and to kill these damned wenches so that my bloodline can live on beyond this nightmare. Are you willing to help?%SPEECH_OFF%\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_79.png[/img]\x7bEncuentras a %employer% con un amuleto alrededor del cuello, aunque en vez de sus arreglos taumaturgicos habituales esta esta recargada de ajo y cebolla. Cuando te mira, sus ojos estan bañados de lágrimas.%SPEECH_ON%¡Oh, mercenario, qué alegría verte! Por favor, siéntate.%SPEECH_OFF%Esquivando serpentinas cargadas de plantas, de ajos y cebollas, te acercas y te sientas frente al hombre. Tus ojos empiezan a escocer y comienzas a llorar. Él continúa.%SPEECH_ON%Mira, esto va a hacer que parezca el mayor maldito estupido que hayas conocido, pero escucha. Hace muchos años, mi primogénito, %protectee%, llegó a este mundo castigado por la enfermedad. Desesperado, busqué la ayuda de unas brujas...%SPEECH_OFF%Levantas la mano. Le preguntas si hizo un pacto y si están aquí para cobrar la deuda. El hombre asiente.%SPEECH_ON%Sí. Dieciocho años es lo que prometieron y esta noche es su decimoctavo año sobre la tierra. No es una tarea sencilla, mercenario. Estas mujeres son peligrosas más allá de lo que imaginas, y apuesto a que serán aún más infernales una vez que se enteren de que me niego a pagar. ¿Puedes ayudarme a proteger a mi hijo?%SPEECH_OFF%Limpiándote los ojos, sopesas las opciones... | Encuentras a %employer% en un rincón de su habitación. Está contorsionado para mirar por la ventana como una marmota desde su guarida. Al ver que tu sombra se extiende sobre él, salta y se agarra el pecho. Aunque su gesto de cobardía podría ser hasta gracioso en otra situación, él se acerca a ti sin ruboriarse.%SPEECH_ON%¡Las brujas han lanzado un hechizo a mi familia! Bueno, a mi linaje. Bueno, más específicamente a mi primogénito, %protectee%. Hace muchas lunas, luché para... ya sabes, con mi esposa. Pedí ayuda a las brujas y me prepararon algo adecuado para el dormitorio. Por supuesto, siendo lo que son las brujas, ¡ahora han vuelto y quieren llevarse a mi primogénito!%SPEECH_OFF%Te sorprende que las brujas le hicieran eso y preguntas jocosamente con que le ayudaron. %employer% te responde bruscamente.%SPEECH_ON%¡Esto no es un asunto de risa! Necesito protección para mi primogénito, ¿estás dispuesto a ayudar a salvar a %protectee% o no?%SPEECH_OFF% | Encuentras a %employer% hojeando libros fervientemente. De una manera que sugiere que los ha leido anteriormente y ahora los revisa apresuradamente en busca de alguna pista que haya pasado por alto. No encuentra ninguna y arroja los tomos de la mesa con un estallido de ira. Al verte, se limpia la frente aliviado.%SPEECH_ON%Preciso de tu ayuda, mercenario. Necesito una espada para proteger a %protectee% durante la noche y para matar a estas malditas brujas y así mi linaje pueda sobrevivir más allá de esta pesadilla. ¿Estás dispuesto a ayudarme?%SPEECH_OFF%\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "\x7bYou'll have to pay us very well in order to take on this enemy. | Convince me this is worth it with a full pouch of crowns. | I expect to be paid very well to fight an enemy as this.\x7d"
        es = "\x7bTendrás que pagarnos muy bien para que nos enfrentemos a esa cosa. | Convénceme de que esto vale la pena con una bolsa llena de coronas. | Espero que me pagues muy bien para luchar contra un enemigo como éste.\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "\x7bSounds to me like you should honor your pact. | This won't be worth the risk. | I'd rather not get the company involved with an enemy like this.\x7d"
        es = "\x7bMe parece que deberías honrar tu pacto. | Ninguna corona valdrá la pena por tanto riesgo. | Preferiría no involucrar a la compañía con un enemigo como éste.\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_79.png[/img]\x7b%randombrother% comes up to you. He's auguring his ear with a pinky.%SPEECH_ON%Hey there captain. You seen any of them saucy broads yet?%SPEECH_OFF%Hearing this, %randombrother2% comes over. He leans in.%SPEECH_ON%Hey, the way I hear it them hexes ARE quite the lookers, but that's how they get ya. They fool ya with their charms and then eat yer very soul.%SPEECH_OFF%Laughing, %randombrother% wipes the wax on %randombrother2%'s garb.%SPEECH_ON%They'll have to go to %randomtown% to get my soul, then, cause another woman done beat them to the punch.%SPEECH_OFF% | You're inspecting inventory when %randombrother% comes up. You'd sent him to scout the lands and he's readied a report.%SPEECH_ON%Sir, nothing sighted as of yet, but I got talking to some of the locals. The way they have it, the witches make pacts with regular folk and then trade on the investment years later, usually with great interest. They said they can fool you into seeing them as licentious minxes. They can bed you right into the grave! I said that sounded like cicada cockamamie to me.%SPEECH_OFF%Nodding, you ask the man what the hell a cicada is. He laughs.%SPEECH_ON%Seriously? It's a kind of nut, sir.%SPEECH_OFF% | The brothers are idling the time away, bantering about women and witches alike and if there's any real significant difference at all. %randombrother% holds his hand out.%SPEECH_ON%Now in all seriousness, I've heard tales of these wenches. They can put a hex on you to make you see things. They'll make you sign bloodpacts and if you don't pay they'll cut your kneecaps out and use them for divination. Hell, when I was a child, my neighbor made a deal with one and then he disappeared. I later saw a mysterious woman walking around with a fresh skull being used for a lantern!%SPEECH_OFF%%randombrother2% nods attentively.%SPEECH_ON%That's incredible, but does anybody know what a witch does?%SPEECH_OFF%\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_79.png[/img]\x7b%randombrother% se acerca a ti. Se está limpiando el oído con el dedo meñique.%SPEECH_ON%Hey, capitán. ¿Has visto a alguna de esas seductoras mujeres hasta ahora?%SPEECH_OFF%Al escuchar esto, %randombrother2% se acerca. Se inclina hacia adelante.%SPEECH_ON%Oye, según tengo entendido, esas brujas son bastante atractivas, pero así es como te atrapan. Te engañan con sus encantos y luego se comen tu propia alma.%SPEECH_OFF%Riendo, %randombrother% limpia la cera en la ropa de %randombrother2%.%SPEECH_ON%Entonces, tendrán que ir a %randomtown% para llevarse mi alma, porque otra mujer me ha ganado esa mano.%SPEECH_OFF% | Estás inspeccionando el inventario cuando %randombrother% se acerca. Lo enviaste a explorar las tierras y ahora ha preparado un informe.%SPEECH_ON%Capitán, hasta ahora no se ha avistado nada, pero he hablado con algunos lugareños. Según ellos, las brujas hacen pactos con la gente común y luego los aprovechan años después, generalmente con gran interés. Dicen que pueden engañarte haciéndote verlas como seductoras. ¡Te pueden llevar a la tumba! Yo les dije que eso sonaba como una locura total.%SPEECH_OFF% | Tus hermanos de armas están pasando el tiempo, bromeando tanto sobre mujeres como sobre brujas y si realmente hay alguna diferencia significativa. %randombrother% extiende la mano.%SPEECH_ON%Ahora en serio, he escuchado historias sobre esas mujeres. Pueden echarte un hechizo para hacerte ver cosas. Te hacen firmar pactos de sangre y si no pagas, te cortan las rótulas y las usan para la adivinación. ¡Demonios, cuando era niño, mi vecino hizo un trato con una y luego desapareció! ¡Más tarde vi a una misteriosa mujer caminando con un cráneo fresco usado como linterna!%SPEECH_OFF%%randombrother2% asiente atentamente.%SPEECH_ON%Es increíble, pero ¿alguien sabe qué hace una bruja?%SPEECH_OFF%\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "Stay focused, lads."
        es = "Manteneos alerta, muchachos."
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_106.png[/img]\x7bA lone woman crosses your path and approaches between a gap of trees. She saunters with her thighs slipping in and out of a silk dress. Her skin is spotless and emerald eyes stare between locks of red with licentiousness you haven't seen since you were just a lad. You know this woman is a witch for such perfection can't stand in this world and in these parts it's like putting on makeup to go to the grave. Which is what she's done. You draw your sword and tell her to face her doom with honor. The witch's skin wrinkles to true, ghastly form, and she cackles with delight.%SPEECH_ON%Ah, for a moment I had you, but the cock slackens, and the pride returns. You've such delightful scents, sellsword. I'll make sure they save you just for me.%SPEECH_OFF%Before you can ask what she means, the two trees she stands between blossom with the stretching of spider legs. Great black bulbs emerge from the thicket and scuttle to the terra below, the webknechts clacking their mandibles with imago hunger. The witch's hands go up and her fingers dance like a puppeteer in command of the clouds above.\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_106.png[/img]\x7bUna mujer solitaria cruza tu camino y se acerca entre un hueco de árboles. Se pasea con un vestido de seda agitado por el viento. Su piel es impecable y sus ojos esmeralda te miran entre mechones de cabello rojo con una intensidad que no has visto desde que eras joven. Sabes que esta mujer es una bruja, ya que tanta perfección no puede existir en este mundo y en estos lugares es como maquillarse para ir a la tumba. Y eso es lo que ha hecho. Sacas tu espada y le ordenas que afronte su destino con honor. La piel de la bruja se arruga revelando su verdadera forma espantosa, y ella se carcajea con deleite.%SPEECH_ON%Ahh, por un momento te tuve, pero eres tan insensible. Tienes unos aromas tan deliciosos, mercenario. Me aseguraré de que te guarden solo para mí.%SPEECH_OFF%Antes de que puedas preguntar qué significa eso, de los dos árboles entre los que se encuentra la bruja notas el movimiento de patas de araña. Grandes bulbos negros emergen del espesor y se arrastran hacia el suelo, las tejedoras de redes chasquean sus mandíbulas con un hambre inmensa. Las manos de la bruja se alzan y sus dedos bailan como un titiritero que comanda desde las nubes del cielo.\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "Spider Queen"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_106.png[/img]\x7b%randombrother% whistles and tips his cap at the beautiful ladies which have arrived seemingly out of nowhere to swoon before the company. You hold the sellsword back and step forward, but before you can speak one of the women holds her hands up and strides to meet you.%SPEECH_ON%Let me show you my true self, sellsword.%SPEECH_OFF%Her arms go to her sides and there turn grey and shrivel like wet almond skin. Once bright and silken hair falls out in long wispy strands until her grotesque skull is bared, the last roots there holding clumped assemblage of gnats and lice like final congregates upon a dying world. She bows, her face up toward you with a yellow grin shorn across it.%SPEECH_ON%We've great power, sellsword, of this you surely see. I offer you a deal.%SPEECH_OFF%She produces a tiny vial in each hand, one carrying a drop of green liquid, the other blue. She smiles and spins them in her fingers as she talks.%SPEECH_ON%A drink for the body, or for the spirit. Men would kill for either. I offer you one in exchange for the firstborn's life. What worth is the offspring of a stranger? You've slaughtered your fair share, have you not? Stand aside, sellsword, and let us have this one. Or confront us, risk your men's lives, and your own, all for some runt who won't remember your face in due time. It's your choice.%SPEECH_OFF%\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_106.png[/img]\x7b%randombrother% silba y se quita el sombrero ante las hermosas damas que han llegado aparentemente de la nada para cautivar a la compañía. Retienes al mercenario y das un paso adelante, pero antes de que puedas hablar, una de las mujeres levanta las manos y se acerca a ti.%SPEECH_ON%Déjame mostrarte mi verdadero yo, mercenario.%SPEECH_OFF%Sus brazos caen a sus costados y se vuelven grises y se marchitan como piel de almendra mojada. El cabello, antes brillante y sedoso, cae en largos mechones enredados hasta que su grotesco cráneo queda al descubierto, las últimas raíces sosteniendo un grupo apelmazado de moscas y piojos como los estertores finales en un mundo moribundo. Ella se inclina, su rostro mirándote con una sonrisa amarillenta dibujada.%SPEECH_ON%Tenemos un gran poder, mercenario, de eso seguramente te has dado cuenta. Te ofrezco un trato.%SPEECH_OFF%La mujer saca un pequeño frasco en cada mano, uno contiene una gota de líquido verde, el otro azul. Sonríe y los hace girar entre sus dedos mientras habla.%SPEECH_ON%Una bebida para el cuerpo o para el espíritu. Los hombres matarían por cualquiera de ellas. Te ofrezco una a cambio de la vida del primogénito. ¿Qué valor tiene el hijo de un desconocido? Seguramente has matado a muchos, ¿no es así? Hazte a un lado, mercenario, y déjanos llevárnoslo. O enfréntanos, arriesga la vida de tus hombres y la tuya propia, todo por un mocoso que no recordará tu rostrocon el tiempo. Es tu elección.%SPEECH_OFF%\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "I will never yield that boy to you hags. To arms!"
        es = "Nunca os entregaremos al muchacho, brujas. ¡A las armas!"
    }
    {
        en = "I desire a drink for the body."
        es = "Deseo la bebida para el cuerpo."
    }
    {
        en = "I desire a drink for the spirit."
        es = "Deseo una bebida para el espíritu."
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_106.png[/img]\x7bThe witch smiles.%SPEECH_ON%A man is nothing without an able body to maneuver him through the world. Here you are, sellsword. Please, do not waste it.%SPEECH_OFF%She tosses you the vial. Twisting through the air, it winks viridian spectra across the earth, each dip of its faint light springing forth a tiny flower out of unseeded mud. You catch the glass. It vibrates in your hand, and the ache of your bones slowly depart, as though your fist had been asleep all this time and you just didn't know it. When you look up for an explanation the witches are already gone. A lone cry is all that's left, piping up in the great distance yet with no way to ascertain just how far off it is. No doubt it is the demise of %employer%'s firstborn.\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_106.png[/img]\x7bLa bruja sonríe.%SPEECH_ON%Un hombre no es nada sin un cuerpo capaz de moverse por el mundo. Aquí lo tienes, mercenario. Por favor, no lo desperdicies.%SPEECH_OFF%Te arroja el frasco. Girando en el aire, destella espectros verde esmeralda sobre la tierra, y en cada destello de su débil luz hace brotar una pequeña flor del lodo, sin semillas aparentes. Atrapas el frasco. Vibra en tu mano y el dolor de tus huesos se va desvaneciendo lentamente, como si tu puño hubiera estado dormido todo este tiempo y tú simplemente no lo supieras. Cuando levantas la vista en busca de una explicación, las brujas ya se han ido. Solo queda un grito solitario, que resuena en la gran distancia sin forma de determinar qué tan lejos está. Sin duda, es la desaparición del primogénito de %employer%.\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "Too good a trade to refuse."
        es = "Demasiado bueno para rechazarlo."
    }
    {
        // this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.Contract.getFaction()).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationCivilianContractFail * 2, "Betrayed " + this.Contract.getEmployer().getName() + " and struck a deal with witches");
        mode = "pattern"
        en = "<this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.m.Faction).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationContractCancel, Broke a contract)>"
        es = "<this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.m.Faction).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationContractCancel, Romper un contrato)>"
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_106.png[/img]\x7bWith a flip of her hand and a bump of her wrist the witch shunts the green vial down her sleeve. The remaining blue vial she holds out to you.%SPEECH_ON%A smart man you are, sellsword.%SPEECH_OFF%She snorts harshly, her fat nose shriveling into a maggot's girth before flopping back down.%SPEECH_ON%I do sense sharp minded men in your blood, sellsword. I'd almost want to have the blood for myself.%SPEECH_OFF%Her eyes stare at you like a cat upon a delimbed cricket, a cricket which still dares to move. But then her smile returns, more gum than teeth, more black than pink.%SPEECH_ON%Ah, well, a deal is a deal. Here you are.%SPEECH_OFF%She throws the vial through the air and by the time you catch it and look back the witches are gone. You hear the faint cry of horrific torture, its distance seemingly both near and far, and you've little doubt that it is the demise of %employer%'s firstborn.\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_106.png[/img]\x7bCon un movimiento de su mano y un golpe de su muñeca, la bruja oculta el frasco verde en su manga. El frasco azul restante lo sostiene frente a ti.%SPEECH_ON%Eres un hombre astuto, mercenario.%SPEECH_OFF%Ella resopla bruscamente, su nariz gorda se encoge hasta adquirir el tamaño de una larva antes de volver a su posición original.%SPEECH_ON%Siento a tus antepasados de mente aguda en tu sangre, mercenario. Casi desearía tener esa sangre para mí misma.%SPEECH_OFF%Sus ojos te miran como un gato que observa a un grillo sin extremidades, un grillo que aún se atreve a moverse. Pero luego su sonrisa regresa, más encías que dientes, más negra que rosada.%SPEECH_ON%Ah, bueno, un trato es un trato. Aquí lo tienes.%SPEECH_OFF%Ella lanza el frasco por el aire y cuando lo atrapas y miras hacia atrás, las brujas ya se han ido. Escuchas el débil llanto de una tortura horrible, su distancia parece estar cerca y lejos al mismo tiempo, y no tienes dudas de que es la muerte del primogénito de %employer%.\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_106.png[/img]\x7b%randombrother% whistles and yells out.%SPEECH_ON%We've company. Nice... beautiful company...%SPEECH_OFF%A licentious looking woman is approaching the band. She sashays over the ground with ease, one finger playing with her ear, the other pinching a stone hanging over her bulging bosom. You clap the sellsword on the shoulder.%SPEECH_ON%That's no ordinary lady.%SPEECH_OFF%Just as the words leave your lips, the woman's ample and youthful features shrivel into a patterned grey and her luxurious hair withers from her pate and what you're left with is a hag, grinning with nothing but evil intentions. To arms! Keep %protectee% safe! | You spot a woman approaching the party. She's wearing bright red and a necklace sways over and between her ample bosom. It's quite the sight, but she is flawless and such a thing does not exist in this world.\n\nYou draw your sword. The lady sees the steel and then looks at you with a wily grin. Plots of hair fall from her head and what's left shrivels into grey wisps. Her skin shrinks into pale valleys and her fingernails grow so long they curl. She points a finger at you and screams that nobody will prevent the conclusion of the pact she's made. You yell out to the company to make sure %protectee% is kept out of harm's way. | A woman is spotted approaching the company. The sellswords are ensorcelled by her beauty, but you know better. You draw your sword and clang it loud enough to draw the ire of this supposed lady. She sneers and her lips snap back with a grin that goes from nearly ear to ear. Her skin tightens until it creases and turns a pale grey. She laughs and laughs as her hair falls out. The witch points a finger at you.%SPEECH_ON%Ah, I smell your ancestry, sellsword, but it matters not where you come from. The pact must be paid by the firstborn's blood and anyone who stands in our way will bleed in kind!%SPEECH_OFF%The company falls into formation and you tell %protectee% to keep his head down.\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_106.png[/img]\x7b%randombrother% silba y grita.%SPEECH_ON%Tenemos compañía. Y... qué hermosa compañía...%SPEECH_OFF%Una mujer de aspecto licencioso se acerca al grupo. Se mueve con soltura sobre el suelo, con un dedo jugueteando con su oreja, y otro pellizcando una piedra colgada en su cuello. Le das un golpecito en el hombro al mercenario.%SPEECH_ON%Esa no es una dama común.%SPEECH_OFF%Justo cuando las palabras salen de tus labios, los generosos y juveniles rasgos de la mujer se marchitan y su lustroso cabello se desprende desde su coronilla, dejando solo una anciana decrepita, sonriendo con intenciones malignas.%SPEECH_ON%¡A las armas! ¡Mantengan a %protectee% a salvo!%SPEECH_OFF% | Ves a una mujer acercándose al grupo. Lleva un vestido rojo brillanteque se balancea al viento. Es una vista impresionante, pero ella es demasiado perfecta y tal cosa no existe en este mundo.\n\nSacas tu espada. La dama ve el acero y luego te mira con una sonrisa astuta. Mechas de cabello caen de su cabeza y lo que queda se marchita en hebras grises. Su piel se marchita y sus uñas crecen tanto que se curvan. Ella te señala con el dedo y grita que nadie impedirá la conclusión del pacto que ha hecho. Gritas al grupo para asegurarte de que %protectee% se mantenga a salvo de cualquier daño. | Se avista a una mujer acercándose al grupo. Los mercenarios están hechizados por su belleza, pero tú sabes muy bien lo que es. Sacas tu espada y la haces sonar lo suficientemente fuerte como para apartar su atención de esta supuesta dama. Ella frunce el ceño y sus labios se despliegan en una sonrisa que va casi de oreja a oreja. Su piel se tensa hasta arrugarse y volverse de un gris pálido. Ríe y ríe mientras su cabello cae. La bruja te apunta con un dedo.%SPEECH_ON%Ah, huelo tus ancestros, mercenario, pero no importa de dónde vengas. El pacto debe ser pagado con la sangre del primogénito y ¡cualquiera que se interponga en nuestro camino sangrará de igual manera!%SPEECH_OFF%El grupo se coloca en formación y le dices a %protectee% que mantenga la cabeza baja. Esto se va a poner feo.\x7d"
    }
    {
        // Text = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_124.png[/img]{As you start your return trip to %employer%, you find %superstitious% staring down at a witch. You can see the damned woman\'s lips are still moving and you rush over. She\'s speaking in curses which you shutup with the heel of your boot. Teeth flutter from rent gums as she laughs. You draw your sword and stab it between her eyes, putting her to rest once and for all. %superstitious% is just about shaking.%SPEECH_ON%She knew all about me! She knew everything, captain! She knew everything! She knew when I\'d die and how!%SPEECH_OFF%You tell the man to ignore every word the witch told him. Nodding, he rejoins the company, but his face grimaces with fortunes that can\'t go unheard.}",
        mode = "pattern"
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_124.png[/img]\x7bAs you start your return trip to %employer%, you find %superstitious% staring down at a witch. You can see the damned woman's lips are still moving and you rush over. She's speaking in curses which you shutup with the heel of your boot. Teeth flutter from rent gums as she laughs. You draw your sword and stab it between her eyes, putting her to rest once and for all. %superstitious% is just about shaking.%SPEECH_ON%She knew all about me! She knew everything, captain! She knew everything! She knew when I'd die and how!%SPEECH_OFF%You tell the man to ignore every word the witch told him. Nodding, he rejoins the company, but his face grimaces with fortunes that can't go unheard.\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_124.png[/img]\x7bMientras comienzas tu viaje de regreso con %employer%, encuentras a %superstitious% mirando fijamente a una bruja. Puedes ver que los labios de la maldita mujer siguen moviéndose y te apresuras hacia allí. Ella está cantando maldiciones, las cuales callas con el talón de tu bota. Los dientes vuelan de sus encías desgarradas mientras ella se ríe. Sacas tu espada y la clavas entre sus ojos, poniéndola en descanso de una vez por todas. %superstitious% está casi temblando.%SPEECH_ON%Ella lo sabía todo sobre mí. ¡Sabía todo, capitán! ¡Sabía todo! Sabía cuándo moriré y cómo.%SPEECH_OFF%Le dices al hombre que ignore cada palabra que la bruja le dijo. Asintiendo, se une nuevamente al grupo, pero su rostro está crispado pensando en maldiciones que ya no podrán ser olvidadas.\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "Don't think about it."
        es = "No pienses en ello"
    }
    {
        // text = this.Contract.m.Dude.getName() + " is afraid"
        mode = "pattern"
        en = "<this.Contract.m.Dude.getName()> is afraid"
        es = "<this.Contract.m.Dude.getName()> tiene miedo"
    }
    {
        en = "Was cursed by a witch"
        es = "Fue maldecido por una bruja"
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_124.png[/img]\x7bAs the men recover from battle, a young peasant runs across the field hollering and whooping. You turn to see him fall before a witch and hold her ghastly, leathery body up, clutching it between his arms and rocking back and forth. Seeing you, he spits curses.%SPEECH_ON%Why'd you do it, huh? Goddam bastards the lot of ya! She was wed to me a fortnight ago and now I must bury her. Well I say take me with her! Do your worst, you savages! This world will bury us both, my love!%SPEECH_OFF%You raise an eyebrow. The man must have been bewitched sometime before your arrival, probably a lackey for the witches. Whatever you think, a few of the men are a bit disturbed by the sight of the grieving boy. However, one hardier sellsword with a slick grin and his hand on his weapon asks if he should grant the kid his request. You shake your head no and order the men back into formation.\x7d "
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_124.png[/img]\x7bMientras los hombres se recuperan de la batalla, un joven campesino corre por el campo gritando y maldiciendo. Te volteas para verlo caer ante una bruja y sostener su cuerpo espantoso y correoso, apretándolo entre sus brazos y balanceándose hacia adelante y hacia atrás. Al verte, escupe maldiciones.%SPEECH_ON%¿Por qué lo hiciste, eh? Malditos bastardos, todos vosotros. Hace quince días nos casamos y ahora debo enterrarla. ¡Pues digo que me lleve con ella! ¡Haz lo peor, salvajes! Este mundo nos enterrará a ambos, ¡mi amor!%SPEECH_OFF%Levantas una ceja. El hombre debe haber sido embrujado antes de tu llegada, probablemente sea ya un lacayo de las brujas. Sea como sea, algunos de los hombres se sienten perturbados por la vista del joven afligido. Sin embargo, un mercenario más valiente, con una sonrisa astuta y la mano en su arma, pregunta si debería cumplir la petición del chico. Niegas con la cabeza y ordenas a los hombres que vuelvan a la formación.\x7d "
    }
    {
        en = "Poor fool."
        es = "Pobre idiota."
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_124.png[/img]\x7bThe battle over, %randombrother% comes to your side. He says %protectee% died during the fight. Says his eyeballs are gone as is his tongue, that his face looks like two wet rags folding in on each other. No point in going back to %employer% now. | You look down at %protectee%'s corpse. The eyeballs have been yanked and hang down his cheeks like wet craw. His face is stretched into a smile, though whatever put it that way couldn't have been the least bit funny. %randombrother% asks if the company should return to %employer% and you shake your head no. | You find %employer%'s firstborn crumpled on the ground. Every joint has been scooped or carved out, though when or how this happened is beyond you. %randombrother% tries to move the body, but it twists and clatters like a stringless puppet. The sellsword grimaces and throws the corpse back to the ground where it rimples into a basket of its own ribcage, the head egglike in the nest. There's no point in returning to %employer% now.\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_124.png[/img]\x7bLa batalla ha terminado y %randombrother% se acerca a tu lado. Te dice que %protectee% murió durante la pelea. Dice que le arrancaron los ojos y que su lengua desapareció, que su rostro parece dos trapos húmedos plegándose uno sobre el otro. Ya no tiene sentido regresar ahora con %employer%. | Miras hacia abajo el cadáver de %protectee%. Los globos oculares han sido arrancados y cuelgan por sus mejillas como caracoles mojados. Su rostro está estirado en una sonrisa, aunque lo que lo puso así no pudo haber sido lo más mínimo de divertido. %randombrother% pregunta si la compañía debería regresar a %employer% y tú niegas con la cabeza. | Encuentras al primogénito de %employer% aplastado en el suelo. Todas las articulaciones han sido arrancadas o cortadas, aunque no entiendes cuándo ni cómo ocurrió esto. %randombrother% intenta mover el cuerpo, pero se retuerce y chasquea como una marioneta sin hilos. El mercenario frunce el ceño y arroja el cadáver de vuelta al suelo, donde se enrosca en una cesta formada por sus propias costillas, con la cabeza como si fuera un huevo en el nido. Ya no tiene sentido regresar ahora con %employer%.\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "Shite, shite, shite!"
        es = "¡Mierda, mierda, mierda!"
    }
    {
        // this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.Contract.getFaction()).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationCivilianContractFail, "Failed to protect " + this.Contract.getEmployer().getName() + "\'s firstborn son");
        mode = "pattern"
        en = "<this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.m.Faction).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationContractCancel, Broke a contract)>"
        es = "<this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.m.Faction).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationContractCancel, Romper un contrato)>"
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_16.png[/img]\x7b%employer% was paying you to protect %protectee%. The firstborn is hard to protect when you leave %townname% and abandon him to the witches. Don't bother going back for your pay. | You had been tasked to keep %protectee% safe in %townname%, or did you forget? Don't bother going back, the firstborn is no doubt already dead or, worse, taken by the witches for some nefarious purpose.\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_16.png[/img]\x7b%employer% te estaba pagando para proteger a %protectee%. Es difícil proteger al primogénito cuando abandonas %townname% y lo dejas a merced de las brujas. Ni te molestes en regresar a por tu pago. | Se te había encomendado la tarea de mantener a salvo a %protectee% en %townname%, ¿o acaso lo habías olvidado? No vale la pena volver, sin duda el primogénito ya está muerto o, peor aún, ha sido llevado por las brujas para algún propósito nefasto.\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "Oh, damn."
        es = "Oh, maldición."
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_79.png[/img]\x7b%employer% embraces %protectee%, holding the firstborn tight. He looks at you.%SPEECH_ON%So it's done then, all the witches are dead?%SPEECH_OFF%You nod. The townsman nods back.%SPEECH_ON%Thank you! Thank you, mercenary!%SPEECH_OFF%He points you to a chest in the corner of the room. It's full of your payment. | You return %protectee% to %employer%. The townsman and firstborn embrace like the telling of two separate dreams of identical circumstance, slowly coming together despite the appeals of reality. Finally, they hug and clench one another and pause to stare at one another to be sure it's all real. You tell %employer% that every witch is dead, but that he should keep the tale to himself. He nods.%SPEECH_ON%Spirits feed on hubris, I know that much, and I shall take this story to the grave. I thank you for what you've done today, sellsword. I thank you to such lengths you could not possibly know. I've but one way to express my appreciation.%SPEECH_OFF%He brings you a satchel of gold. The sight of the bag bulging with coin brings a warm smile to your face. | %protectee% runs from your side and into the arms of %employer%. The townsman looks over his firstborn's shoulders.%SPEECH_ON%So it's done then, we are free of the curse?%SPEECH_OFF%You shrug and respond.%SPEECH_ON%You're free of the witches.%SPEECH_OFF%The townsman purses his lips and nods.%SPEECH_ON%Well, that's good enough. Your payment is over there in the satchel, as much as promised.%SPEECH_OFF%\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_79.png[/img]\x7b%employer% abraza a %protectee%, sosteniendo al primogénito con fuerza. Te mira.%SPEECH_ON%¿Entonces está hecho, todas las brujas están muertas?%SPEECH_OFF%Asientes con la cabeza. El hombre te devuelve el gesto de cabeza.%SPEECH_ON%¡Gracias! ¡Gracias, mercenario!%SPEECH_OFF%Él te señala un cofre en la esquina de la habitación. Está lleno con tu pago. | Devuelves a %protectee% a %employer%. El hombre y su primogénito se abrazan como en aquellas historias de tiernos relatos de hijos separados de sus padres que vuelven a reencontrarse al final de muchas tragedias. Finalmente, se separan y se aferran el uno al otro, deteniendose para mirarse mutuamente y asegurarse de que todo sea real. Le dices a %employer% que todas las brujas están muertas, pero que debería mantener la historia en secreto. Él asiente.%SPEECH_ON%Me llevaré esta historia a la tumba. Te agradezco por lo que has hecho hoy, mercenario. Te lo agradezco más de lo que podrías imaginar. Solo tengo una forma de expresar mi agradecimiento.%SPEECH_OFF%Él te entrega una bolsa llena de oro. La vista de la bolsa abultada con monedas te saca una cálida sonrisa. | %protectee% corre desde tu lado hacia los brazos de %employer%. El hombre te mira por encima de los hombros de su primogénito.%SPEECH_ON%¿Entonces está hecho, estamos libres de la maldición?%SPEECH_OFF%Encoges los hombros y respondes.%SPEECH_ON%Estáis libres de las brujas.%SPEECH_OFF%El hombre del pueblo frunce los labios y asiente.%SPEECH_ON%Bueno, eso es suficiente. Tu pago está allí en la bolsa, tanto como se te prometió.%SPEECH_OFF%\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "All worked out in the end."
        es = "Todo salió bien al final."
    }
    {
        // this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.Contract.getFaction()).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationCivilianContractSuccess, "Protected " + this.Contract.getEmployer().getName() + "\'s firstborn son");
        mode = "pattern"
        en = "<this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.m.Faction).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationContractCancel, Broke a contract)>"
        es = "<this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.m.Faction).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationContractCancel, Romper un contrato)>"
    }
    {
        en = "superstitious"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "protectee"
        es = ""
    }
    // FILE: D:\GOG\Battle Brothers\!Downloads\bbros\bin\comparer\original_current\scripts\contracts\contracts\hunting_lindwurms_contract.nut
    {
        en = "Hunting Lindwurms"
        es = "Cazadores de dragones, digo, Lindwurms"
    }
    {
        // "Hunt down the Lindwurms around " + this.Contract.m.Home.getName()
        mode = "pattern"
        en = "Hunt down the Lindwurms around <this.Contract.m.Home.getName()>"
        es = "Caza a los Lindwurms alrededor de <this.Contract.m.Home.getName()>"
    }
    {
        // local party = this.World.FactionManager.getFactionOfType(this.Const.FactionType.Beasts).spawnEntity(tile, "Lindwurm", false, this.Const.World.Spawn.Lindwurm, 100 * this.Contract.getDifficultyMult() * this.Contract.getScaledDifficultyMult(), this.Contract.getMinibossModifier());
        mode = "pattern"
        en = "<this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.m.Faction).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationContractCancel, Broke a contract)>"
        es = "<this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.m.Faction).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationContractCancel, Romper un contrato)>"
    }
    {
        en = "A Lindwurm - a wingless bipedal dragon resembling a giant snake."
        es = "Un Lindwurm, un dragón bípedo sin alas que se asemeja a una serpiente gigante."
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_77.png[/img]\x7b%employer% is staring into a basket when you find him. A few peasants are off in the corner scratching themselves and looking rather tense. You ask what is going on. Your potential employer brings you over to the basket and inside you find a snake slithering about. It's a docile one, and the colors aren't arranged in a manner to suggest it carries poison in its belly. You tell him as much. He shrugs and closes the lid.%SPEECH_ON%Gonna kill it and eat it anyhow, take its skin for a dagger sheath. What I need you to do is go find a much larger snake than this. I'm talking lindwurms, sellsword. Bigguns. Roaming about, eating folks in the hinterland. You the kind to see this situation sorted?%SPEECH_OFF% | You find %employer% mucking about his personal library that's more cobweb than knowledge. He seems to sense your entrance and asks if you know about lindwurms. Before you can answer he wheels around, scroll in hand.%SPEECH_ON%I need you to go out to the hinterland. We got a couple of them monsters on our hands. They're killing farmers, peddlers. Hell, some of those folks were even well liked. I figure you'd be just the man we'd need to get these beasts off our backs. Are you interested?%SPEECH_OFF%You see his scroll unfurl a bit to reveal a crudely drawn woman and her exposed breast. The man hurriedly rolls it back up and stows it behind his back. He smiles.%SPEECH_ON%Well are ya?%SPEECH_OFF% | A line of peasants stand outside %employer%'s door. You cut by them all and when a few protest you grab the handle on your sword. %employer% jumps out of his door and intervenes.%SPEECH_ON%Ease up, ease up everyone. This is the mercenary I wanted to hire. Sir, please, let me explain the short tempers. Lindwurms are ravaging the countryside and we need a strapping sellsword such as yourself to slay them all. Are you interested?%SPEECH_OFF%The once angry peons now stare at you as though you were a savior.\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_77.png[/img]\x7bEncuentras a %employer% mirando dentro de una cesta cuando lo encuentras. Algunos campesinos están en un rincón rascándose y luciendo bastante tensos. Le preguntas qué está pasando. Tu potencial empleador te lleva hacia la cesta y dentro encuentras una serpiente deslizándose. Es una serpiente dócil, y los colores no están dispuestos de manera que sugiera que lleva veneno en su vientre. Se lo dices. Él encoge los hombros y cierra la tapa.%SPEECH_ON%De todas formas la mataré y me la comeré, y usaré su piel para la funda de un puñal. Lo que necesito que hagas es ir a buscar una serpiente mucho más grande que esta. Estoy hablando de Lindwurms, mercenario. Grandes. Vagando por ahí, devorando gente en la periferia. ¿Eres capaz de resolver esta situación?%SPEECH_OFF% | Encuentras a %employer% husmeando en su biblioteca personal, que tiene más telarañas que conocimiento. Parece percibir tu entrada y te pregunta si sabes algo sobre Lindwurms. Antes de que puedas responder, se da vuelta con un pergamino en la mano.%SPEECH_ON%Necesito que te engargues de esas critaruas que están vagando por nuestros campos. Un par de ellas. Están matando a los granjeros, a los mercaderes. Diablos, algunos de esos tipos incluso eran apreciados en la localidad. Supongo que tú serías el hombre que necesitamos para librarnos de estas bestias. ¿Te interesa?%SPEECH_OFF%Ves cómo su pergamino se desenrolla un poco para revelar un dibujo burdo de una mujer de buen ver. El hombre rápidamente lo enrolla y lo esconde detrás de su espalda. Sonríe.%SPEECH_ON%¿Bueno, qué dices?%SPEECH_OFF% | Una fila de campesinos está afuera de la puerta de %employer%. Pasas junto a todos ellos y cuando algunos protestan, agarras la empuñadura de tu espada. %employer% sale de su puerta e interviene.%SPEECH_ON%Aguardad, aguardad todos. Este es el mercenario que quería contratar. Señor, por favor, permítame explicar los malos humores. Los Lindwurms están arrasando el campo y necesitamos a un valiente mercenario como tú para matarlos a todos. ¿Te interesa?%SPEECH_OFF%Los campesinos, que antes estaban enojados, ahora te miran como si fueras su salvador.\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "\x7bThat's a mighty big task you're asking of us. | I expect to be well compensated to fight an enemy such as this. | I expect you to make me a rich man for this.\x7d"
        es = "\x7bEsa es una tarea extraordinaria la que nos estás pidiendo. | Espero ser bien recompensado por luchar contra un enemigo como este. | Espero que me hagas un hombre rico por esto.\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "\x7bSounds more like what you need are heroes and fools. | It's not worth the risk. | I don't think so.\x7d"
        es = "\x7bSuena más a que lo que necesitas son héroes o estúpidos. | No vale la pena el riesgo. | No estamos interesados. | No somos cazadores de dragones.\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_66.png[/img]\x7b%randombrother% holds a sleeve of scaly skin at the length of his weapon. He wiggles it around, the shedding scratching itself in dry rasps. You tell him to put it down and to be on guard. The lindwurms are no doubt close. | %randombrother% states that he once heard the story of a lindwurm that killed someone without eating them.%SPEECH_ON%That's right. They said it spewed green water and the man just melted into his own boots. Said it looked like soup with his shins for stirring.%SPEECH_OFF%A disgusting tale, but one that hopefully keeps the men rightfully on their toes. Those lindwurms can't be far. | The tracks have the grass flattened in a snaking pattern with holes set to the sides. %randombrother% crouches beside the patterns.%SPEECH_ON%Either a plough with no dig or this be the critters we're lookin' for.%SPEECH_OFF%You nod. The lindwurms can't be far.\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_66.png[/img]\x7b%randombrother% sostiene un trozo de piel escamosa de la longitud de su arma. Lo mueve alrededor, y al desprenderse produce un sonido rasposo y seco. Le dices que deje de jugar y que esté alerta. Los Lindwurms sin duda están cerca. | %randombrother% afirma que una vez escuchó la historia de un Lindwurm que mató a alguien sin comérselo.%SPEECH_ON%Así es. Dijeron que escupió agua verde y el hombre se derritió dentro de sus propias botas. Dicen que parecía una sopa de pescado con sus huesos como espinillas.%SPEECH_OFF%Es una historia repugnante, pero esperemos que mantenga a los hombres alerta. Esos Lindwurms no deben estar lejos. | Las huellas han aplastado la hierba en un patrón ondulado con agujeros en los lados. %randombrother% se agacha junto a las marcas.%SPEECH_ON%O es un arado sin cavar o estas son las criaturas que estamos buscando.%SPEECH_OFF%Asientes. Los Lindwurms no deben estar lejos.\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "Be on the lookout!"
        es = "¡Centraos en el trabajo!"
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_129.png[/img]\x7bYou're checking the map when %randombrother% calls out. Looking up, you see the lindwurms emerging from a hole in the ground, great sheets of dust streaming off their sides. Their bodies sway low to the ground as they whip their way toward the %companyname%. You draw out your sword and order the men into formation. | The company comes upon a cave lined with boulders at its front. But as you draw near, the rocks uncoil and flip mid-air and legs shoot out their bellies to plant the landings of what are clearly lindwurms. You step back as the beasts wriggle the dust off their backs and snap their maws with guttural croaking. They turn to you, eyes blinking, and begin to lazily come forward as though your mercenaries were but a minor inconvenience to dispatch. You order the company into formation. The monsters, perhaps sensing you're more of a threat, suddenly surge forward, powerfully hissing as their bodies sidewinder over the ground with surprising speed. | The %companyname% steps toward a hill with bones crunching under every step. %randombrother% shushes the company and points to the hilltop. Lindwurms are curved about its crest as though to embroider the very earth. Seemingly sensing your stare, the beasts unfurl and slumber down the slope, some half twisting like children rolling down a hill. Their maws clap and snap, tongues licking the dust out of their eyes, altogether looking like sleepwalking critters more than murderous monsters. But the second their feet step upon the flat earth they seize up and bolt forward, their snaky shapes streaking across the boneyard, powdered bonemeal rooster tailing up in their wake. Drawing your sword, you urgently order the men to formation.\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_129.png[/img]\x7bMientras revisas el mapa, %randombrother% llama tu atención. Al levantar la vista, ves a los Lindwurms emergiendo de un agujero en el suelo, grandes nubes de polvo fluyendo a lo largo de sus costados. Sus cuerpos se balancean cerca del suelo mientras se abren paso hacia %companyname%. Sacas tu espada y ordenas a los hombres que formen. | La compañía se encuentra con una cueva bordeada de rocas en su entrada. Pero a medida que te acercas, las rocas se desenrollan y giran en el aire, y las piernas brotan de sus vientres como anclajes para levantar esos enormes cuerpos... Son claramente Lindwurms. Retrocedes mientras las bestias sacuden el polvo de sus espaldas y chasquean sus mandíbulas con gruñidos guturales. Se vuelven hacia ti, parpadean los ojos y comienzan a avanzar perezosamente, como si tus mercenarios fueran solo una pequeña molestia que deben eliminar. Ordenas a la compañía que forme. Los monstruos, quizás percibiendo que eres una amenaza mayor, avanzan de repente, silbando poderosamente mientras sus cuerpos se desplazan lateralmente sobre el suelo con sorprendente rapidez. | %companyname% se acerca a una colina con huesos crujiendo bajo cada paso. %randombrother% hace callar a la compañía y señala la cima de la colina. Los Lindwurms están enroscados alrededor de su cresta como si se enredaran en la tierra misma. Aparentemente, al sentir tu mirada, las bestias se desenrollan y descienden la pendiente en una especie de movimiento hipnótico, algo parecido al movimietno de una caña al viento. Sus mandíbulas chocan y chasquean, sus lenguas limpian el polvo de sus ojos, dando la impresión de ser criaturas sonámbulas más que monstruos asesinos. Pero en el momento en que sus pies tocan la tierra plana, se tensan y se lanzan hacia adelante, sus formas serpenteantes cruzando el cementerio de huesos, levantando nubes de polvo de huesos triturados a su paso. Sacando tu espada, ordenas urgentemente que los hombres formen.\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_17.png[/img]\x7bYou find the lindwurms slithering about a dugout in the ground, but before you can go to battle a man interrupts you with a humanly hiss. He looks like he hasn't shaved in days and he's got a fat satchel yoked over both shoulders and a bandana bunches up his hair like potted sagebrush. Aside from his haggard looks there isn't a weapon on him. You ask what he wants. He speaks hurriedly and in a hushed tone.%SPEECH_ON%You here to kill the lindwurms?%SPEECH_OFF%The nasty snakelike monsters are wriggling around in the distance, seemingly playing with one another like puppies or kittens would. You nod and tell him they're killers and you've been paid to slay them all. The man purses his lips.%SPEECH_ON% See that gleam in their coat? That's unique to them, and they are the last of their kind. These are rarified lindwurms, sir, and it'd be a horrid ruin upon the world itself for them to be made wholly nonexistent. How about I give you %bribe% crowns and, uh, you was paid by someone, right? So you take this, too.%SPEECH_OFF%He pulls a great, scratchy lindwurm skinsuit out of his satchel and offers to hand it over.%SPEECH_ON%Tell your employer you'd found and killed the lindwurms and show them this. They won't know the difference. And if you think about doublecrossing me here let me say this, I look a hint of crazy but I'm actually a barrel of it. And a crazy fark like myself wouldn't survive following these giant, wonderful, and beautiful lindwurms around if he didn't know a thing or two, got it?%SPEECH_OFF%\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_17.png[/img]\x7bEncuentras a los Lindwurms deslizándose alrededor de una cueva en el suelo, pero antes de que puedas entrar en batalla, un hombre te interrumpe con un siseo humano. Parece que no se ha afeitado en días, lleva una gran bolsa colgada sobre ambos hombros y una bandana le recoge el cabello enmarañado como mala hierba. Aparte de su aspecto salvaje, no lleva ninguna arma. Le preguntas qué quiere. Él habla apresuradamente y en tono bajo.%SPEECH_ON%¿Vienes a matar a los Lindwurms?%SPEECH_OFF%Los desagradables monstruos parecidos a serpientes se retuercen a lo lejos, aparentemente jugando entre ellos como cachorros o gatitos. Asientes y le dices que son monstruos y que te han pagado para matarlos a todos. El hombre frunce los labios.%SPEECH_ON%¿Ves ese brillo en su piel? Eso es único en ellos, y son los últimos de su especie. Estos son lindwurms raros, señor, y sería una horrible pérdida para el mundo que dejen de existir por completo. ¿Qué tal si te doy %bribe% coronas y...? Eh, te ha pagado alguien ya, ¿verdad? Así que toma esto también.%SPEECH_OFF%Saca unas escamas de piel de Lindwurm grandes y ásperas de su bolsa y ofrece entregártelas.%SPEECH_ON%Dile a tu empleador que encontraste y mataste a los Lindwurms y muéstrales esto. Ellos no notarán la diferencia. Y si piensas en traicionarme aquí, déjame decirte que puedo parecer un poco loco, pero en realidad soy una caja loca de sorpresas. Y un loco como yo no sobreviviría siguiendo a estos maravillosos y hermosos Lindwurms si no supiera unas cuantas cosas, ¿entendides?%SPEECH_OFF%\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "Out of the way, fool. We have a beast to slay."
        es = "Fuera del camino, estupido. Tenemos una bestia que matar."
    }
    {
        en = "Very well. I accept your offer."
        es = "Muy bien. Acepto tu oferta."
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_17.png[/img]\x7bThe way you see it the lindwurms here are not truly your problem, you were just paid to take care of them. And you could potentially get paid twice if the crazy lindwurm protector's skinsuit fools %employer%.\n\nYou take the deal. The fool thanks you and hugs you unexpectedly. He smells awful and his hair has become so matted and thick that tiny little bugs have bored out caves there and can be seen staring at you. A tiny skink scuttles between the stinky stalks and snatches one of the bugs. You throw the man back and wish him luck in whatever the hell he's doing. He puts out his thumb and pinky finger and wags the hand.%SPEECH_ON%You, sir, are righteous.%SPEECH_OFF%\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_17.png[/img]\x7bSegún como tu lo ves, los Lindwurms aquí no son realmente tu problema, solo te pagaron para encargarte de ellos. Y potencialmente podrías ser pagado dos veces si las escamas de piel de loco protector de Lindwurms engaña a %employer%.\n\nAceptas el trato. El loco te agradece y te abraza inesperadamente. Huele terrible y su cabello está tan enmarañado y grueso que pequeños bichos han cavado cuevas allí y parecen mirarte fijamente. Un pequeño lagarto corre entre los tallos malolientes y atrapa uno de los insectos. Empujas al hombre hacia atrás y le deseas suerte en lo que demonios esté haciendo. Él extiende el pulgar y el meñique y agita la mano.%SPEECH_ON%Tú, señor, en realidad tienes un noble corazon.%SPEECH_OFF%\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "Righteous. Right."
        es = "Noble. Maravilloso."
    }
    {
        // text = "You gain [color=" + this.Const.UI.Color.PositiveEventValue + "]" + bribe + "[/color] Crowns"
        mode = "pattern"
        en = "You gain <v:val_tag> Crowns"
        es = "Obtienes <v> Coronas"
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_129.png[/img]\x7bDust clouds belch from a distant cave entrance. As you draw near, you can hear the hiss of the lindwurms and intermittent growling of something else entirely.%SPEECH_ON%Look, sir!%SPEECH_OFF%%randombrother% points to the rim of the cave dugout. There's a pair of nachzehrers tackling a lindwurm, one being slung around as it holds onto the tail, the other is hand fighting its maw to not get bit. The monsters are fighting one another!\n\nShaking your head, you draw out your sword and order the men into formation. Looks like this is going to be a proper barnstormer if there ever was one.\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_129.png[/img]\x7bNubes de polvo brotan de una cueva distante. A medida que te acercas, puedes oír el siseo de los Lindwurms y el gruñido intermitente de algo completamente distinto.%SPEECH_ON%¡Mira, jefe!%SPEECH_OFF%%randombrother% señala el borde de la cueva excavada. Hay un par de nachzehrers enfrentándose a un lindwurm, uno de ellos acaba de ser arrojado mientras se aferra a la cola, el otro lucha con sus mandíbulas para evitar ser mordido. ¡Los monstruos están peleando entre ellos!\n\nSacudiendo la cabeza, desenvainas tu espada y ordenas a los hombres que se formen. Parece que esto va a ser una auténtica tormenta... Si alguna vez hubo una igual.\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "I don't know if this is good or bad."
        es = "No sé si esto es bueno o malo."
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_41.png[/img]\x7bYou spot a merchant and his wagon trundling up the road. The rear of the wagon lifts upward and the caravan hand on the back is launched like a ragdoll. A streak of green slips behind the caravan and another goes to the side. The merchant turns and jumps into the wagon as lindwurms start their assault. These are no doubt the creatures you've been looking for. At your command, the %companyname% can rush forward before the caravan is destroyed.\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_41.png[/img]\x7bAvistas a un mercader y su carreta avanzando por el camino. La parte trasera de la carreta traquetea haciendo que el ayudante de la caravana sentado atras se balancee como una muñeca de trapo. Una sombra verde se desliza detrás de la caravana y otra se desliza hacia uno de sus costados. El mercader se gira y salta dentro de la carreta mientras los Lindwurms inician su ataque. Sin duda, estas son las criaturas que has estado buscando. Bajo tu mando, %companyname% avanza rápidamente antes de que la caravana sea destruida.\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "Attack!"
        es = "¡Atacad!"
    }
    {
        en = "Fall back!"
        es = "¡Retroceded!"
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_41.png[/img]\x7bThe battle is over. You have the men skin a few of the lindwurms while you go and talk to the merchant. He bows in thanks and kisses your ringless finger.%SPEECH_ON%Thank you, sir, thank you! Ohhh, my wagon! My goods!%SPEECH_OFF%His eyes twist away to the remains of his caravan. He collapses, his knees in the debris, and shakes his head.%SPEECH_ON%I wish I had anything to pay you with, stranger, but it's all gone.%SPEECH_OFF%But then he holds a finger up. He jumps back to his feet and asks if you have a map. You show what you got, and he takes out a quill pen.%SPEECH_ON%Here, I know of a spot that is said to hold great treasure. I don't know if that's true or not, but the rumor's as good as gold if it is!%SPEECH_OFF%Yeah, if. You thank the merchant for his generosity anyway and wish him better luck on his journey ahead. As for the %companyname%, it needs to return to %employer% to get paid.\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_41.png[/img]\x7bLa batalla ha terminado. Tienes a los hombres desollando algunos de los Lindwurms mientras te acercas a hablar con el mercader. Él se inclina en agradecimiento y besa tu mano sin anillos.%SPEECH_ON%¡Gracias, señor, gracias! ¡Ohhh, mi carreta! ¡Mis mercancías!%SPEECH_OFF%Sus ojos se apartan hacia los restos de su caravana. Se derrumba, con las rodillas entre los escombros, y sacude la cabeza.%SPEECH_ON%Desearía tener algo con qué pagarte, extraño, pero todo se ha perdido.%SPEECH_OFF%Pero entonces él levanta la cabeza. Se levanta de un salto y te pregunta si tienes un mapa. Muestras el que tienes, y él saca una un trozo de carbon.%SPEECH_ON%Aquí, sé de un lugar que se dice que guarda un gran tesoro. No sé si eso es cierto o no, ¡pero el rumor vale tanto como el oro si es ceirto!%SPEECH_OFF%Sí, si. Agradeces al mercader por su generosidad de todos modos y le deseas mejor suerte en su viaje futuro. En cuanto a %companyname%, necesita regresar con %employer% para cobrar tu pago.\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "We should pay a visit to that place one day."
        es = "Deberíamos hacer una visita a ese lugar algún día."
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_60.png[/img]\x7bThe battle is over. You have half your men go about skinning the lindwurms to show %employer% when you get back. The other half sift through the remains of the merchant's caravan. There is nothing of note to find, not even gold. Anything of value has been smashed to pieces in the fighting. The merchant himself has been torn in half and the legs sit a way away with their pockets turned out and empty, %randombrother% squatting beside the remains. He nods.%SPEECH_ON%Well, that's a sorry way to go. Broke and even more broke.%SPEECH_OFF%You nod back and then holler at the men to pack their things. It's time to return to your employer and collect your pay.\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_60.png[/img]\x7bLa batalla ha terminado. La mitad de tus hombres se encarga de desollar a los Lindwurms para mostrarle a %employer% cuando regreséis. La otra mitad busca entre los restos de la caravana del mercader. No hay nada de interés que encontrar, ni siquiera oro. Todo lo que tenía valor ha sido destrozado durante la lucha. El propio mercader ha sido partido en dos y las piernas están aparte, con sus bolsillos girados y vacíos, %randombrother% agachado junto a los restos. Él asiente.%SPEECH_ON%Bueno, es una triste forma de terminar. Roto y aún más arruinado.%SPEECH_OFF%Tú asientes de vuelta y luego gritas a los hombres que recojan sus cosas. Es hora de regresar con tu empleador y cobrar tu paga.\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "At least we put an end to those beasts."
        es = "Al menos acabamos con esas bestias."
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_130.png[/img]\x7bFighting the lindwurms was like taking a butterknife and jabbing it into a basket of vipers. They fought like something from another world, hissing and spewing and biting, but they were no match for the %companyname%'s resolve and skill. You have the men scalp and skin the creatures and ready them for a return to %employer% for a well earned payday. | The lindwurms lay in well earned ruin. Your company goes about poking the corpses at a distance, making sure the bastards are truly dead. A few gargle and flip over, but that's about the last of their living issuances. You order the overgrown lizards scalped and skinned. %employer% will be expecting proof, after all. | You crouch beside a lindwurm and take your hand over its skin. The way you figure, the scales are long and sharp enough to cut your fingers off if jammed in between the wedges. You then stand akimbo over the head and stare into its maw, getting a measure of its teeth with your hands and its gullet with the steel of your sword. %randombrother% comes to your side and asks what they're to do next. You unsheathe your sword from the lindwurm's throat, wipe it clean, and sheathe it proper. You order the men to skin a few of the beasts and ready a return to %employer%. | The battle over, you have the lindwurms skinned and dressed for anything of value. It isn't long for the field to stink of the skinks, the overly large lizards being shorn of the scales that once protected them. Their sickly, glistening musculature bared for all to see, a nakedness and vulnerability is wrought upon the once and always monsters. %randombrother% snorts and runs a sleeve beneath his nose. He nods at his handiwork.%SPEECH_ON%Nothing more than a common creature, just a shade larger than it ought to be.%SPEECH_OFF%Damn right. You order the men to collect what they've got and ready a return to %employer%.\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_130.png[/img]\x7bLa lucha contra los Lindwurms fue como tomar un cuchillo de mantequilla y clavarlo en una cesta de víboras. Luchaban como si fueran seres de otro mundo, silbando, escupiendo y mordiendo, pero no eran rival para la determinación y habilidad de %companyname%. Tienes a los hombres desollando y despojando a las criaturas, listas para regresar con %employer% y recibir tu merecido pago. | Los Lindwurms yacen por fin muertos. Tu compañía se mueve entre los cadáveres a distancia, asegurándose de que los bastardos estén realmente muertos. Algunos gorgotean y se retuercen, pero esos son los últimos de sus espasmos finales. Ordenas que los lagartos gigantes sean desollados y despojados. %employer% estará esperando pruebas, después de todo. | Te agachas junto a un Lindwurm y pasas la mano sobre su piel. Según tu cálculo, las escamas son lo suficientemente largas y afiladas como para cortarte los dedos si te los atraparan entre ellas. Luego te colocas de pie sobre su cabeza y miras dentro de su boca, midiendo el tamaño de sus dientes con tus manos y la profundidad de su garganta con el acero de tu espada. %randombrother% se acerca a tu lado y pregunta qué deben hacer a continuación. Sacas tu espada de la garganta del lindwurm, la limpias y la envainas adecuadamente. Ordenas a los hombres que desuellen a algunas de las bestias y se preparen para regresar con %employer%. | Terminada la batalla, tienes a los Lindwurms desollados de cualquier cosa de valor. No pasa mucho tiempo antes de que el campo huela a los escincomorfos, los lagartos excesivamente grandes despojados de las escamas que una vez los protegieron. Su músculo enfermizo y brillante queda al descubierto para que todos lo vean, una desnudez y vulnerabilidad que recae sobre las criaturas que siempre fueron monstruos. %randombrother% resopla y pasa la manga por debajo de su nariz. Asiente con satisfacción a su trabajo.%SPEECH_ON%Nada más que una criatura común, solo un poco más grande de lo que debería ser.%SPEECH_OFF%Maldita sea, tienes razón. Ordenas a los hombres que recojan lo que tienen y se preparen para regresar con %employer%.\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "We did it."
        es = "Lo hicimos"
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_77.png[/img]\x7bYou enter %employer%'s room dragging in some lindwurm flesh. He looks up from his desk, eyes the scales and long sleeve of reptilian skin, glances at you, then glances at his paymaster and gives a steady nod. The paymaster takes a satchel of crowns and hands them over. %employer% returns to his work, addressing you as he writes with a quill.%SPEECH_ON%Good work, sellsword. Reports of the bastards has died off in total, so I wager our money here has been put to good use. Leave the skin. I've a man who can fix up some mean boots with it.%SPEECH_OFF%Did the %companyname% just work to get this fool new boots? You shake your head and make your leave. | %employer% welcomes you and your booty, a long, scratchy, scaly, scraping piece of lindwurm skin. You heave it across the floor where it skitters like a stiff leather jacket. The mayor nods.%SPEECH_ON%Very, very well done, good sir! Most excellent. Your pay, as promised.%SPEECH_OFF%The man hands you a satchel heavy with well earned crowns. | %employer% is found warming himself beside a fire. He turns around in the seat to see the lindwurm flesh you have brought in with you. The mayor nods.%SPEECH_ON%Quite alright work, sellsword. I'm curious, do the lizard bastards grow their limbs back? I've heard tales of the reptilian sort carrying such tricks.%SPEECH_OFF%You shrug and state each creature was slain with as much scientific curiosity a good sword can muster. %employer% purses his lips.%SPEECH_ON%Ah. Right. Well your pay is in the corner there, as much as agreed upon.%SPEECH_OFF%He returns to the fire, cozying himself up in a blanket and sipping at the lip of a steamy mug. | %employer% is found outside and surrounded by raucous peasants. You yell over the crowd and display the lindwurm skin which you've brought. The crowd quiets for a moment, whispers amongst its numbers, then returns to shouting. You purse your lips and elbow your way into the mob and demand the pay which you are owed. %employer% yells at the peons to spread out and let him breathe. While two guards stand close, he hands you a leather satchel.%SPEECH_ON%Good work, sellsword. If it ain't all there feel free to come back and kill me. I won't mind, not on this damned day.%SPEECH_OFF%As you take the satchel and leave, a peasant jabs his finger at the mayor.%SPEECH_ON%Tellin' ya, that damned bastard, my supposed 'neighborly neighbor', stole my birds and if he don't return them I'mma burn his whole farm to the farkin' ground!%SPEECH_OFF%\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_77.png[/img]\x7bEntras a la habitación de %employer% arrastrando un pedazo de carne de Lindwurm. Él levanta la mirada desde su escritorio, observa las escamas y la larga piel de reptil, te mira a ti y luego a su tesorero, asintiendo firmemente. El tesorero toma una bolsa de monedas de oro y te las entrega. %employer% vuelve a su trabajo y te habla mientras escribe con una pluma.%SPEECH_ON%Buen trabajo, mercenario. Los informes sobre los desgraciados han desaparecido por completo, así que apuesto a que nuestro dinero aquí ha sido bien utilizado. Deja la piel. Tengo un hombre que puede hacer unas botas excelentes con ella.%SPEECH_OFF%¿Acaso %companyname% acaba de trabajar para conseguirle botas nuevas a este necio? Sacudes la cabeza y te marchas. | %employer% te da la bienvenida junto con tu botín, un largo y áspero trozo de piel de Lindwurm. Lo arrojas al suelo, donde se desliza como una chaqueta de cuero rígida. El alcalde asiente.%SPEECH_ON%Muy, muy bien hecho, buen señor. Excelente trabajo. Aquí está tu pago, como prometi.%SPEECH_OFF%El hombre te entrega una bolsa pesada con las merecidas monedas de oro. | %employer% se encuentra calentándose al lado de una hoguera. Se voltea en el asiento para ver la carne de Lindwurm que has traído contigo. El alcalde asiente.%SPEECH_ON%Buen trabajo, mercenario. Me pregunto, ¿los repugnantes lagartos regeneran sus extremidades? He escuchado cuentos sobre seres reptilianos que hacen tales trucos.%SPEECH_OFF%Encoges los hombros y declaras que cada criatura fue derrotada con la misma curiosidad científica que puede ofrecer una buena espada. %employer% frunce los labios.%SPEECH_ON%Ah, entiendo. Bueno, tu pago está en la esquina allí, tanto como acordamos.%SPEECH_OFF%Él vuelve a la hoguera, acurrucándose con una manta y sorbiendo el contenido de una taza humeante. | %employer% se encuentra fuera, rodeado de campesinos ruidosos. Gritas por encima de la multitud y muestras la piel de Lindwurm que has traído. La multitud se calla por un momento, susurra entre sus miembros y luego vuelve a gritar. Frunces los labios y te abres paso entre la multitud, exigiendo el pago que te deben. %employer% les grita a los campesinos que se dispersen y lo dejen respirar. Mientras dos guardias permanecen cerca, él te entrega una bolsa de cuero.%SPEECH_ON%Buen trabajo, mercenario. Si no está todo ahí, siéntete libre de volver y matarme. No me importará, no en este maldito día.%SPEECH_OFF%Mientras tomas la bolsa y te marchas, un campesino señala al alcalde con el dedo.%SPEECH_ON%Te lo digo, ese maldito desgraciado, mi supuesto 'vecino amistoso', robó mis gallinas y si no los devuelve, voy a quemar toda su maldita granja hasta los cimientos.%SPEECH_OFF%\x7d"
    }
    {
        // this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.Contract.getFaction()).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationCivilianContractSuccess, "Rid the town of lindwurms");
        mode = "pattern"
        en = "<this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.m.Faction).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationContractCancel, Broke a contract)>"
        es = "<this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.m.Faction).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationContractCancel, Romper un contrato)>"
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_43.png[/img]\x7bYou find %employer% in his room and it is full of guards. Not sure what is going on, you display the lindwurm's flesh to the mayor and demand your pay. His fingers clap together before fanning forward like a lumber saw.%SPEECH_ON%I don't think that will be happening, sellsword. I don't know where you got that goddam skinsuit you're carrying, and trust me I can tell it's old as shite and not some new flay, but I'm still getting reports of lizards tearing the hinterlands a new arshole so if you don't mind, please kindly leave this town before I sic a whole different predator upon ya.%SPEECH_OFF%Taking a deep breath, you eye the guards. There's too many to fight off. %employer% sighs.%SPEECH_ON%If it's your honor you're thinking to protect, don't. I already talked these folks down from ambushing your arse the second you were to walk through that door. I did that out of little respect I have left. Don't waste it, hm?%SPEECH_OFF%Fair enough. It is what it is and you've no one else to blame but yourself anyhow. You close the door and take your leave.\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_43.png[/img]\x7bEncuentras a %employer% en su habitación y está llena de guardias. Sin estar seguro de lo que está sucediendo, muestras la piel del Lindwurm al alcalde y exiges tu pago. Sus dedos chocan y luego se abren como una sierra de madera.%SPEECH_ON%No creo que eso vaya a suceder, mercenario. No sé de dónde sacaste ese maldito traje de piel que llevas, pero bien parece ser más vieja que el demonio y no una piel recién arrancada. Aún recibo informes de lagartos destrozando las tierras fronterizas, así que si no te importa, por favor, deja amablemente esta ciudad antes de que suelte sobre ti a otro depredador completamente diferente.%SPEECH_OFF%Respiras hondo y observas a los guardias. Son demasiados para enfrentarlos. %employer% suspira.%SPEECH_ON%Si estás pensando en proteger tu honor, no lo hagas. Ya convencí a esta gente de no emboscarte en cuanto pusieras un pie dentro de esa puerta. Lo hice con el poco respeto que me queda. No lo desperdicies, ¿de acuerdo?%SPEECH_OFF%Está bien. Es lo que hay y no tienes a nadie más a quien culpar que a ti mismo, de todos modos. Cierras la puerta y te marchas.\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "Not entirely surprising."
        es = "No es del todo sorprendente."
    }
    {
        // this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.Contract.getFaction()).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationCivilianContractFail * 2, "Tried to swindle the town out of money");
        mode = "pattern"
        en = "<this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.m.Faction).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationContractCancel, Broke a contract)>"
        es = "<this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.m.Faction).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationContractCancel, Romper un contrato)>"
    }
    // FILE: D:\GOG\Battle Brothers\!Downloads\bbros\bin\comparer\original_current\scripts\contracts\contracts\hunting_sand_golems_contract.nut
    {
        // "Hunt down what kills people in the desert around " + this.Contract.m.Home.getName()
        mode = "pattern"
        en = "Hunt down what kills people in the desert around <this.Contract.m.Home.getName()>"
        es = "Buscar y elimina lo que está matando a la gente en el desierto alrededor de <this.Contract.m.Home.getName()>"
    }
    {
        // party = this.World.FactionManager.getFactionOfType(this.Const.FactionType.Beasts).spawnEntity(tile, "Ifrits", false, this.Const.World.Spawn.SandGolems, 110 * this.Contract.getDifficultyMult() * this.Contract.getScaledDifficultyMult(), this.Contract.getMinibossModifier());
        mode = "pattern"
        en = "<this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.m.Faction).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationContractCancel, Broke a contract)>"
        es = "<this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.m.Faction).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationContractCancel, Romper un contrato)>"
    }
    {
        en = "Creatures of living stone shaped by the blistering heat and fire of the burning sun of the south."
        es = "Criaturas de piedra viva moldeadas por el abrasador calor y fuego del sol ardiente del sur."
    }
    {
        en = "Earthquake"
        es = ""
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_162.png[/img]\x7b%employer% lifts his head and seemingly regards you down the bridge of his nose. It is a powerful sneer, but he does bring you in. The Vizier claps his hands and a servant comes to you with a scroll, unfurls it, and reads.%SPEECH_ON%Ifrits have been spotted in the sands. A Crownling - that is you, traveler - is to....%SPEECH_OFF%The Vizier claps his hands again.%SPEECH_ON%Could be him, servant. That COULD be him. Be mindful with your distinctions.%SPEECH_OFF%You know the servant wants to say he didn't write the scroll, but he keeps that to himself. He finishes the announcement.%SPEECH_ON%...is to be incentivized to dispel the scorching sands back into their natural state. Annihilation of said monsters would be compensated with %reward% crowns.%SPEECH_OFF%The scroll rolls back up, the servant catches it at the sides, and he slides back out of scene. You see the Vizier again, but he is not paying attention as a slave girl feeds him grapes. | A Vizier by the name of %employer% greets you, though all the grace in the meeting is entirely invested into the bureaucratic side of the discussion.%SPEECH_ON%Crownling, Ifrits stalk the sands. Your services have been summoned to help deal with it. If you do not agree to the compensation of %reward% crowns, then we shall summon ourselves another in your stead.%SPEECH_OFF% | You enter a room to find a number of viziers buried beneath the bodies of slave girls. There is a good deal of giggling and playful skin pulling, but most notably nobody seems to notice you are there. Save for an older man who shuffles over and bows.%SPEECH_ON%Crownling, the Vizier %employer% has summoned a Crownling for the task of hunting Ifrits.%SPEECH_OFF%The old man glances over, then straightens up. The next time he speaks it is stripped of the high falutin nonsense.%SPEECH_ON%They're large sandy bastards, and they are tearing up the countryside. I warn you that they are not to be trifled with, so don't let all this show of pomp and gold fool you into tackling something you shouldn't. %reward% crowns are on the table if you accept.%SPEECH_OFF%Straightening up and clearing his throat, the old man loudly asks.%SPEECH_ON%Do you accept your summons?%SPEECH_OFF%\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_162.png[/img]\x7b%employer% levanta la cabeza y parece mirarte desde el puente de su nariz con un poderoso desprecio, pero de todos modos te involucra en la conversación. El Visir aplaude sus manos y un sirviente se acerca a ti con un pergamino, lo desenrolla y lee.%SPEECH_ON%Se han avistado Ifrits en las arenas. Un Buscador de Fortuna - es decir, tú, viajero - debe...%SPEECH_OFF%El Visir vuelve a aplaudir sus manos.%SPEECH_ON%Podría ser él, sirviente. PODRÍA ser él. Sé cuidadoso con tus distinciones.%SPEECH_OFF%Sabes que el sirviente quiere decir que no fue él quien escribió el pergamino, pero se guarda eso para sí mismo. Termina el anuncio.%SPEECH_ON%...se espera que el Buscador de Fortuna, es decir, tú, seas incentivado para dispersar las abrasadoras arenas a su estado natural. La aniquilación de dichas criaturas será recompensada con %reward% coronas.%SPEECH_OFF%El pergamino se enrolla nuevamente, el sirviente lo recoge por los lados y se retira de la escena. Ves nuevamente al Visir, pero no presta atención mientras una esclava le da uvas. | Un Visir llamado %employer% te saluda, y a pesar de la pompa y circunstancia del encuentro, parece más una reunión de negocios que una audiencia.%SPEECH_ON%Buscador, los Ifrits merodean por las arenas. Se han convocado tus servicios para lidiar con ello. Si no aceptas la compensación de %reward% coronas, entonces convocaremos a otro en tu lugar.%SPEECH_OFF% | Entras en una habitación y encuentras a varios visires descansando entre cojines. No parrecen querer darse cuenta de tu presencia. Excepto un hombre mayor que se acerca y hace una reverencia.%SPEECH_ON%Buscador, el Visir %employer% ha convocado a un Buscador de Fortuna para la tarea de cazar Ifrits.%SPEECH_OFF%El anciano echa un vistazo a su alrededor y luego se endereza. La próxima vez que habla, deja de lado el tono pomposo y el discurso grandilocuente.%SPEECH_ON%Son grandes bastardos arenosos, y están destrozando los cultivos. Te advierto que no son para tomarse a la ligera, así que no dejes que todo este espectáculo de pompa y oro te engañe para enfrentar algo que no deberías. Se ofrecen %reward% coronas si aceptas.%SPEECH_OFF%Enderezándose y aclarándose la garganta, el anciano pregunta en voz alta.%SPEECH_ON%¿Aceptas tu convocatoria?%SPEECH_OFF%\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "\x7bI'm interested, go on. | Hunting down an enemy like this doesn't come cheap. | This is going to cost you. | Hunting a mirage in the desert. What is not to like. | The %companyname% can help, for the right price.\x7d"
        es = "\x7bEstoy interesado, hablemos. | Cazar a un enemigo como este no va ha salir barato. | Esto va ha salirte caro. | ¿Cazar un espejismo en el desierto? ¿Por qué no? | %companyname% podemos ayudarte, por el precioa decuado.\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "\x7bThis doesn't sound like our kind of work. | I won't lead the men on a wild goose chase through the desert. | I don't think so. | I say no. The men prefer known enemies of flesh and blood.\x7d"
        es = "\x7bEsto no parece ser nuestro tipo de trabajo. | No voy a liderar a los hombres en una persecución inútil por el desierto. |  No estomos interesados. | Digo que no. Los hombres prefieren enemigos conocidos de carne y hueso.\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_161.png[/img]\x7bWhile tracking the mysterious Ifrits, you come across an old crone who has feet like leather. She bows at your appearance.%SPEECH_ON%Ah, slaves of the coin, it is the Ifrits you seek, yes? Of course. I can see it on your faces.%SPEECH_OFF%She pauses and points out toward the dunes where you are heading.%SPEECH_ON%We are of these lands, understand? We are one with them, and when we banish and harm and be cruel to one another, the sands take to the sides of those who have been wronged. Fear yourself not the monster, but the reason it has been created, for that reason permeates these sands, and in that reasoning you shall slay but one monster but not salt the waters which cause it to spring eternal.%SPEECH_OFF% | You come across a well in the desert. A man offers you a few buckets of refreshment, remarking that the water below is unending. With not a single farm in sight, you've reason to believe there's enough water below to slake one's thirst for all time. The man does seem to sense you've other purpose in these parts though.%SPEECH_ON%I take it is the Ifrits you seek, is it not?%SPEECH_OFF%Nodding, you ask him how he knew that. He grins.%SPEECH_ON%Cause I've seen them, and what they've done, and I believed it would only be a short time until a professional army or slave of the crown would come along to resolve their disputes. The Ifrit is a monster of vengeance, and it will only succumb to that which ushered it out of the earth: cruelty.%SPEECH_OFF%Finishing your drink, you thank the stranger for his words and continue on. | A few corpses in the sands. Some have slid halfway down a dune. Another rests at the base, another far from the base. Seemingly thrown that way. The bodies being uncovered by the sands hints at some recency in the deaths. It seems whatever attacked the people pulverized them with incredible force then spent a brief time mutilating what was left, sanding the flesh down to the bone in spots. The Ifrits must be close...\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_161.png[/img]\x7bMientras rastreas a los misteriosos Ifrits, te encuentras con una anciana descalza con la suela de los pies duros como el cuero. Ella se inclina ante tu presencia.%SPEECH_ON%Ah, esclavos de la moneda, ¿es a los Ifrits a quienes buscáis, verdad? Por supuesto. Puedo verlo en vuestros rostros.%SPEECH_OFF%Ella se detiene y señala hacia las dunas hacia donde te diriges.%SPEECH_ON%Nosotros somos de estas tierras, ¿comprendéis? Estamos unidos a ellas, y cuando desterramos y hacemos daño y somos crueles entre nosotros, las arenas se unen a aquellos que han sido agraviados. No temas al monstruo en sí, sino a la razón de su creación, pues esa razón impregna estas arenas, y en esa razón mataréis a un solo monstruo, pero no salaréis las aguas que lo hacen brotar eternamente.%SPEECH_OFF% | Encuentras un pozo en el desierto. Un hombre te ofrece unos cuantos baldes de agua, comentando que el agua debajo es inagotable. Sin una sola granja a la vista, tienes tus dudas sobre creer que haya suficiente agua abajo para saciar la sed de todos por siempre. Sin embargo, el hombre parece percibir que tienes otro propósito en estas tierras.%SPEECH_ON%Supongo que sois vosotros los que buscáis a los Ifrits, ¿verdad?%SPEECH_OFF%Asintiendo, le preguntas cómo lo supo. Él sonríe.%SPEECH_ON%Porque los he visto y se lo que han hecho, y creí que solo sería cuestión de tiempo hasta que un ejército profesional o algun Buscador de Fortuna viniera para resolver sus disputas. Los Ifrits son monstruos de venganza, y solo cederá ante aquello que lo hizo surgir de la tierra: la crueldad.%SPEECH_OFF%Terminas de beber, agradeciendo al desconocido sus palabras y continúas adelante. | Unos cuantos cadáveres en las arenas. Algunos se han deslizado hasta la mitad de una duna. Otro descansa en su base, y otro lejos de ella. Aparentemente, arrojados al azar. Los cuerpos desenterrados por las arenas casi parecen engullidos por ellas. Parece que lo que atacó a estas personas los pulverizó con una fuerza increíble y luego pasó un breve tiempo mutilando lo que quedó, lijando la carne hasta dejar los huesos al descubierto en algunos lugares. Los Ifrits deben de estar cerca...\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "Watch where you step."
        es = "Mirad donde pisais."
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_153.png[/img]\x7bAt first glance, it is a mirage. The desert shifts and blurs at distance, and to the unwitting or exhausted, these sights alter and change to be whatever one wishes them to be. It is when the Ifrit turns around and rips a human body in half and slings the parts across the sands that you realize this is not an imagined monstrosity at all. It is a hellish creature, a spinning cloud of sand with stones shifting about to give it some shape of what a man might be. And as it leans forward you realize if nothing else it does share a man's disposition toward armed strangers on its land: murderous rage. | The sand dunes ahead slip from top to bottom, the sands curling toward you like a sheet being pulled off a bed. But a stone appears unearthed and another and another, and when the first stone rises you realize it is an Ifrit. A growl scratches out, a deep bellow that is crackling with the clash of sandy winds. The Ifrit takes some sloping, disjointed shape of a man, stones for bones, and sands for flesh, and it charges forth. | You find the Ifrit holding a distended sense of an arm down toward the earth. Sand blows out of the arm and the grains press a dead body into the desert, the force ripping away the clothes, and then peppering open the flesh, then it is stripped to the bone entirely and when the Ifrit is done it turns to you and ferociously growls.\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_153.png[/img]\x7bA simple vista, parece un espejismo. El desierto cambia y se desdibuja a lo lejos, y para aquellos desprevenidos o exhaustos, estas visiones se transforman y cambian para ser lo que uno desee que sean. Pero es cuando el Ifrit se gira, desgarrando un cuerpo humano por la mitad y arrojando las partes por las arenas, que te das cuenta de que esto no es una monstruosidad imaginada. Es una criatura infernal, un torbellino de arena con piedras que se mueven para darle una apariencia de lo que podría ser un hombre. Y al ver como se voltea hacia ti, te das cuenta de que, en el fondo, comparte la disposición de un hombre hacia extraños armados en su tierra: una rabia asesina. | Las dunas de arena se deslizan de arriba a abajo, las arenas se enrollan hacia ti como una sábana que se despega de una cama. Pero una piedra emerge de la tierra, y luego otra, y otra más, y cuando la primera piedra se levanta, te das cuenta de que es un Ifrit. Un gruñido rasga el aire, un profundo rugido que cruje con el choque de los vientos arenosos. El Ifrit adquiere una forma desigual y desarticulada de un hombre, piedras por huesos y arenas por carne, y se lanza hacia adelante. | Encuentras al Ifrit sosteniendo un brazo distendido hacia la tierra. La arena explota del brazo y las partículas presionan un cuerpo muerto en el desierto, la fuerza arranca la ropa y luego desgarra la carne, dejándola completamente desnudo hasta los huesos, y cuando el Ifrit termina, se vuelve hacia ti y gruñe ferozmente.\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_160.png[/img]\x7bAs you reach the top of a sand dune, it immediately stretches away from your very feet. You find yourself sinking and roll out before the earth swallows you whole. As you tumble down the slopes, you find the adjacent dunes similarly receding, and in your belly there is a tremble, not of fear, but of the ground itself violently shaking. When it is over, you stand up and steady your feet. And Ifrits come to stand at the rim of the crater and look down at you. They scream at you, hissing ferocity scraping with the sound of sand crystalizing past one another. You are surrounded! | You pause and sigh. The desert just seems to go on and on, and just as you think that you find the view shrinking away. It takes a moment for you to realize the ground is shaking and as the sand shifts you are being sucked down. You roll away from danger and find yourself tumbling down the sand slopes. At the bottom you quickly jump to your feet and draw your weapon to face what you already know is there: the Ifrits. They stand at the rim of the dunes, staring down at you as though they trapped a rat. Their bodies are clouds of sand with floating stones to give a sort of staccato shape of what might be a man. They growl and descend downward!\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_160.png[/img]\x7bAl llegar a la cima de una duna de arena, esta se extiende rápidamente desde tus propios pies. Te encuentras hundiéndote y ruedas hacia afuera antes de que la tierra te trague por completo. Mientras resvalas por la ladera, ves que las dunas adyacentes también retroceden, y en tu vientre hay un temblor, no de miedo, sino de la propia tierra temblando violentamente. Cuando todo termina, te levantas y aseguras tus pies. Y los Ifrits se colocan en el borde del cráter y te miran desde arriba. Te gritan, su ferocidad silbante raspa con el sonido de la arena cristalizándose al rozar una con otra. ¡Estás rodeado! | Te detienes y suspiras. El desierto parece extenderse infinitamente, pero justo cuando piensas eso, la vista parece encogerse. Lleva un momento darte cuenta de que el suelo tiembla y, mientras la arena se desplaza, te estás hundiendo. Te alejas del peligro y comienzas a rodar por las laderas de arena. Al llegar al fondo, te levantas rápidamente y desenvainas tu arma para enfrentar lo que ya sabes que está allí: los Ifrits. Se encuentran en el borde de las dunas, mirándote como si hubieran atrapado a una rata. Sus cuerpos son nubes de arena con piedras flotantes que les dan una forma entrecortada, como la de un hombre. Gruñen y descienden hacia ti.\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_160.png[/img]\x7bThe battle is over, but the Ifrits do not depart entirely. The sands which made their bodies bubble, and the stones which framed their bodies shift and tremble angrily. You can hear the hiss not of some monstrosity at all, but what is clearly the sound of humans. They hiss, the sound right at your ears. You twist around to find nothing. They hiss behind you again, and this time when you turn around the noise is gone and the sands are still and the stones earth bidden as they should be. The beasts are slain, and possibly whatever inhabited them, too. It is time to return to %employer%. | The Ifrits are slain, but the bodies only seemed to serve as vessels for something far more sinister. You catch glimpses of spirits soaring toward the horizon, but perhaps it is merely the desert itself playing tricks on you. There's no saying, except to say that the beastly nature of the Ifrits has been defeated and %employer% needs to pay you for that alone.\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_160.png[/img]\x7bLa batalla ha terminado, pero los Ifrits no se marchan por completo. Las arenas que hicieron burbujear sus cuerpos y las piedras que enmarcaron sus formas se agitan y tiemblan con enojo. Puedes escuchar los susurros que no proviene de ninguna monstruosidad, sino que es claramente el sonido de humanos. Susurran, justo en tus oídos. Giras en busca de algo, pero no encuentras nada. Susurran detrás de ti nuevamente, y esta vez cuando te volteas, el ruido ha desaparecido y las arenas están quietas y las piedras reposan en la tierra como deberían. Las bestias están muertas, y posiblemente también lo que las habitaba. Es hora de regresar con %employer%. | Los Ifrits han sido derrotados, pero los cuerpos parecían ser meros recipientes para algo mucho más siniestro. Alcanzas a vislumbrar espíritus que se elevan hacia el horizonte, pero quizás sea simplemente el desierto jugándote una mala pasada. No hay forma de saberlo con certeza, excepto decir que la naturaleza monstruosa de los Ifrits ha sido vencida y %employer% debe pagarte solo por eso.\x7d"
    }
    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_162.png[/img]\x7bYou try and enter %employer%'s room, but a guard stops you. With a bit of a brow raiser, you tell the man that the Vizier is expecting you. The guard stares down at you.%SPEECH_ON%He expects you, he does not wish to see you. Those are two different things, Crownling. The scouts have confirmed your doings in the deserts. Here is your pay, as agreed upon. Now depart. I said depart!%SPEECH_OFF%The guard stamps his foot and all the guards posted down the hall stamp their feet and face you. Now, you are no genius, but you get the feeling that it is probably time to go. | %employer% stares down at you from a throne of pillows and women. Slave women, judging by their chains, though perhaps that is just their thing. The sad faces say otherwise. The Vizier speaks, but it is almost as if it is a show for all those listening and you're just playing a part.%SPEECH_ON%Crownling, my little hawks have told me of your doings. The Ifrits have been put to rest and their sorcery shall be a threat no more! Such is the power of my gold. It is work which we have agreed to, and for that %reward% crowns is your reward.%SPEECH_OFF%As a servant hands you a purse of coins, the Vizier flitters his fingers dismissively toward you.%SPEECH_ON%Begone.%SPEECH_OFF% | You find %employer% turning an hourglass one way and back again. The sands are equally pitted to the halved bulbs. There are servants all along the wall with their heads bowed. At the adjacent wall are a line of cushions upon which sit gaudy women whose hair is tended to by women in chains. The Vizier slams the hourglass down. He crouches behind it, his eyes visile to either side of the glass, the pupils staring inward. You finally notice that the sands within are not shifting as they should, but instead twirling angrily.%SPEECH_ON%The Ifrits have been dealt with, this my hawks have told me so. Crownling, you have done your job as you were summoned to do, and for that you are to be given %reward% crowns. I hope your time in the deserts rewarded you not only with experience of combat and war, but also graced you with the notion of contemplation.%SPEECH_OFF%You're not sure what this man means. He yanks the hourglass up and starts to tilt it side to side again. The sands thrash as they bounce from side to side. A servant hands you a purse of coins and you could not depart the room faster. | You return to %employer% to find the Vizier facedown on a couch. A number of old men are knuckling his back or rubbing his feet. Across the room, a woman fans herself. She is entirely naked and her eyes never leave the Vizier's, nor his hers. The man talks almost as if you are not even in the room at all.%SPEECH_ON%Servants, hand this Crownling the purple purse with black thread. Crownling, you have done well in handling the spirits of the sands, these so-called Ifrits. It was my gold which ushered you into those deserts, and my gold which rewarded you, so let the scribes know that it is my gold which has settled this issue truly, and that the tool, this Crownling, was paid fairly.%SPEECH_OFF%A servant stabs a purple sack into your arms. The Vizier groans as an old man plants an elbow right into his ass crack.%SPEECH_ON%Need I tell you to depart, Crownling?%SPEECH_OFF% | An old man with no eyebrows greets you, stopping you just outside %employer%'s door. He pushes a sack into your arms.%SPEECH_ON%There are %reward% crowns in there, as the Vizier agreed.%SPEECH_OFF%The man looks around for listeners and seems to nod when you seeing you are the only one within earshot.%SPEECH_ON%The Ifrits are not just demons, they are wronged spirits, and you have set them free. But they will likely return, because men such as %employer% have nothing to offer this world but a waterfall of gold, and they forget that beneath that waterfall many are crushed or drowned.%SPEECH_OFF%You're not sure what he means, but an approaching guard ends the conversation and the old man slaps you across the face.%SPEECH_ON%Begone, Crownling! Take your pay and leave my sight!%SPEECH_OFF% | Of all things, a troop of cats welcome you enter %employer%'s room. You can just barely see the Vizier on the other side of a mesh with a crowd of equally amused onlookers.\n\n You look down and see the cats are carting around a piece of wood with a purse atop it. You look back up. The silhouettes are holding their breath. Sighing, you bend down and pick up the purse. One voyeur erupts and claps but is met by stern hushing. Their task complete, the cats fall down and spread out on the tile, dozing or grooming themselves or pawing at the shadows which flitter in the sunbeams. You're pretty sure %reward% crowns are in the sack, but not wanting to spend another second in the room you step outside to count.\x7d"
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_162.png[/img]\x7bIntentas ingresar a la habitación de %employer%, pero un guardia te detiene. Con cierto gesto de sorpresa, le dices al hombre que el Visir te está esperando. El guardia te mira fijamente.%SPEECH_ON%Él te espera, pero no desea verte. Son dos cosas diferentes, Buscador. Los exploradores han confirmado tus acciones en los desiertos. Aquí está tu pago, según lo acordado. Ahora, ¡retírate! ¡Dije que te retires!%SPEECH_OFF%El guardia golpea el suelo con el pie y todos los guardias apostados en el pasillo hacen lo mismo y te enfrentan. Ahora, aunque no eres un genio, pero sientes que probablemente es hora de irte. | %employer% te mira desde un trono de almohadas y mujeres. Mujeres esclavas, a juzgar por sus cadenas, aunque quizás eso sea solo su apariencia. Las caras tristes confirman tus sospechas. El Visir habla, pero es casi como si esto fuera un espectáculo para todos los presentes y tú solo estás interpretando un papel.%SPEECH_ON%Buscador, mis pequeños halcones me han hablado de tus acciones. Los Ifrits han sido silenciados y su hechicería ya no será una amenaza. Tal es el poder de mi oro. Es el trabajo que hemos acordado, y por eso recibirás %recompensa% coronas como tu recompensa.%SPEECH_OFF%Mientras un sirviente te entrega una bolsa de monedas, el Visir hace un gesto despectivo con los dedos hacia ti.%SPEECH_ON%Vete.%SPEECH_OFF% | Encuentras a %employer% volteando un reloj de arena de un lado a otro. La arena está igualmente distribuida en cada una de las mitades. Hay sirvientes a lo largo de la pared con la cabeza inclinada. En la pared contigua, hay una fila de cojines sobre los cuales se sientan mujeres pomposas cuyo cabello es atendido por mujeres encadenadas. El Visir golpea el reloj de arena. Se agacha detrás de él, sus ojos visibles a ambos lados del vidrio, las pupilas mirando hacia adentro. Finalmente, notas que la arena no se mueve como debería, sino que gira enfurecidamente.%SPEECH_ON%Los Ifrits han sido tratados, eso me han dicho mis halcones. Buscador, has cumplido con tu trabajo tal como te convocaron, y por eso recibirás %recompensa% coronas. Espero que tu tiempo en los desiertos no solo te haya brindado experiencia en combate y guerra, sino que también te haya otorgado iluminación.%SPEECH_OFF%No estás seguro de lo que este hombre quiere decir. Él levanta el reloj de arena y comienza a inclinarlo de un lado a otro nuevamente. La arena se agita mientras rebota de un lado a otro. Un sirviente te entrega una bolsa de monedas y no puedes salir de la habitación más rápido. | Regresas con %employer% y encuentras al Visir boca abajo en un sofá. Varios hombres mayores le dan golpes en la espalda o le frotan los pies. El hombre habla como si ni siquiera estuvieras en la habitación.%SPEECH_ON%Sirvientes, entreguad a este Buscador de Fortuna la bolsa púrpura con hilo negro. Buscador, has manejado bien los espíritus de las arenas, llamados Ifrits. Fue mi oro el que te condujo a esos desiertos y mi oro el que te recompensó, así que hagamos saber a los escribas que fue mi oro el que resolvió verdaderamente este asunto y que la herramienta, este Busador, fue pagado justamente.%SPEECH_OFF%Un sirviente te lanza una bolsa morado a tus manos. El Visir gime cuando un anciano le planta un codo justo en los omoplatos.%SPEECH_ON%¿Necesito decirte que te vayas, Buscador?%SPEECH_OFF% | Un anciano sin cejas te saluda y te detiene justo afuera de la puerta de %employer%. Te entrega una bolsa a tus manos.%SPEECH_ON%Hay %recompensa% coronas ahí dentro, como acordó el Visir.%SPEECH_OFF%El hombre mira a su alrededor por si hubiera otros oyentes y parece asentir cuando ve que eres el único que puede escuchar.%SPEECH_ON%Los Ifrits no son solo monstruos, son espíritus agraviados, y tú los has liberado. Pero es probable que regresen, porque hombres como %employer% no tienen nada que ofrecer a este mundo más que rios de oro de oro, y olvidan que debajo de ese rio muchos son arrastrados y ahogados.%SPEECH_OFF%No estás seguro de lo que quiere decir, pero un guardia que se acerca pone fin a la conversación y el anciano te abofetea en la cara.%SPEECH_ON%¡Vete, Buscador! ¡Toma tu paga y desaparece de mi vista!%SPEECH_OFF% | De todas las cosas, una tropa de gatos te da la bienvenida a la habitación de %employer%. Apenas puedes ver al Visir al otro lado de una celosía junto a una multitud de espectadores igualmente entretenidos.\n\nMiras hacia abajo y ves que los gatos arrastran un trozo de madera con una bolsa encima. Miras hacia arriba. Las vagas siluetas contienen la respiración. Suspirando, te agachas y recoges la bolsa. Un mirón estalla en aplausos, pero recibe una seria reprimenda del resto. Una vez que han completado su tarea, los gatos se acuestan y se dispersan por el suelo, durmiendo, acicalándose o jugando con las sombras que se mueven en los rayos de sol. Estás bastante seguro de que hay %recompensa% coronas en la bolsa, pero sin querer pasar ni un segundo más en la habitación, sales afuera para contarlas.\x7d"
    }
    {
        // this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.Contract.getFaction()).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationNobleContractSuccess, "Rid the city of Ifrits");
        mode = "pattern"
        en = "<this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.m.Faction).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationContractCancel, Broke a contract)>"
        es = "<this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.m.Faction).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationContractCancel, Romper un contrato)>"
    }
    // FILE: D:\GOG\Battle Brothers\!Downloads\bbros\bin\comparer\original_current\scripts\contracts\contracts\hunting_schrats_contract.nut
    {
        en = "Haunted Woods"
        es = "Bosque encantado"
    }
    {
        // "Hunt down what kills people in the woods around " + this.Contract.m.Home.getName()
        mode = "pattern"
        en = "Hunt down what kills people in the woods around <this.Contract.m.Home.getName()>"
        es = "Rastrea lo que mata a la gente en los bosques alrededor de <this.Contract.m.Home.getName()>"
    }
    {
        // party = this.World.FactionManager.getFactionOfType(this.Const.FactionType.Beasts).spawnEntity(tile, "Schrats", false, this.Const.World.Spawn.Schrats, 100 * this.Contract.getDifficultyMult() * this.Contract.getScaledDifficultyMult(), this.Contract.getMinibossModifier());
        mode = "pattern"
        en = "<this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.m.Faction).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationContractCancel, Broke a contract)>"
        es = "<this.World.FactionManager.getFaction(this.m.Faction).addPlayerRelation(this.Const.World.Assets.RelationContractCancel, Romper un contrato)>"
