    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_04.png[/img]\x7bHe nods.%SPEECH_ON%Yes. Good. I was thinking about payment for your task earlier. | He smiles.%SPEECH_ON%This will make you a rich man, my friend. | He takes a deep breath.%SPEECH_ON%Very well, this is what I'm prepared to offer you. | He puts his hand on your shoulder, smiling reaffirmingly.%SPEECH_ON%I think I know an adequate compensation for your services. | He gesticulates with his hands, pointing at his fingers as if counting something, but it means nothing to you.%SPEECH_ON%Judging from experience, this is good payment for the task. | He nods. %SPEECH_ON%You look able, so I am willing to pay quite a bit. | He jingles with a bag of coins.%SPEECH_ON%This will be yours if you help me out on this. | He opens the palm of his hands.%SPEECH_ON%I'm tight on crowns, so before you ask, this is all I have right now. | %SPEECH_ON%Rest assured that what I'm offering you now is a fine prize for your work.\x7d "
        es = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_04.png[/img]\x7b%SPEECH_START%¿Esto es entonces?  | Respira profundamente.%SPEECH_ON% | Suspira.%SPEECH_ON% | %SPEECH_START%Es justo.  | %SPEECH_START%Bien, bien.  | %SPEECH_START%Si es necesario,  | %SPEECH_START%Bien. ¿Qué tal esto?  | %SPEECH_START%Claro, claro, lo entiendo.  | %SPEECH_START%Me parece razonable.  | %SPEECH_START%Interesante. Creo que esto sería más apropiado entonces.  | %SPEECH_START%¿Aceptarías esto en su lugar?  | %SPEECH_START%Permíteme hacerte la siguiente oferta.  | %SPEECH_ON%Aceptable. ¿Aceptarías esto en su lugar?  | %SPEECH_START%Muy bien. Ante tus exigencias, te ofrezco esto.  | %SPEECH_START%Terminemos con esto rápidamente. Aquí está mi nueva oferta.  | %SPEECH_START%Todos somos amigos aquí, ¿no? Vamos a ver... \x7d"
