    {
        en = "[img]gfx/ui/events/event_74.png[/img]\x7b%SPEECH_START%You act as if you were the only ones to hold a sword for coin. I think I'll look elsewhere for the men I need. Good day.%SPEECH_OFF% | %SPEECH_START%My patience has limits, too, and I think I'm wasting my time here.%SPEECH_OFF% | %SPEECH_START%I've had enough of this! I'm sure I'll find someone else to do the job!%SPEECH_OFF% | %SPEECH_START%Do not insult my intelligence! Forget about this contract. We're done.%SPEECH_OFF% | He's face turns red with anger.%SPEECH_ON%Get out of here, I'm not in the habit of making deals with greedy devils!%SPEECH_OFF% | He sighs. %SPEECH_ON%Just... forget it. I shouldn't have trusted you in the first place. Leave me so I can look for other, more sensible men.%SPEECH_OFF% | %SPEECH_START%I really thought we had a good relationship here. But know that I can only be pushed so far. I don't think this is working out. I'll take my leave.%SPEECH_OFF% | %SPEECH_START%This has been an utter waste of time for me. Don't bother coming back until you learned some reason.%SPEECH_OFF%\x7d"
