    }
    {
        en = "This character's body has mutated and propagates poisons and other hazardous substances through the bloodstream much more slowly, allowing them to be disposed of without serious health effects. Curiously, this doesn't seem to affect their ability to get drunk."
        es = "El cuerpo de este personaje ha mutado y propaga venenos y otras sustancias peligrosas a través del torrente sanguíneo mucho más lentamente, lo que permite eliminarlos sin efectos graves para la salud. Curiosamente, esto no parece afectar su capacidad para emborracharse."
